    window.TEMAS = [{"id": "tema3", "numero": 3, "titulo": "Introducción al lenguaje Kotlin", "resumen": "Qué es Kotlin, Logcat, variables, tipos, null safety, funciones, clases, colecciones, estructuras de control, lambdas y control de errores.", "badge": "Kotlin Language", "tech": "kotlin", "icon": "kotlin", "secciones": [{"id": "tema3-s1", "titulo": "1. ¿Qué es Kotlin?", "html": "<p><strong>Kotlin</strong> es un lenguaje de programación <strong>fuertemente tipado</strong> desarrollado por <strong>JetBrains</strong> (los creadores de IntelliJ IDEA, en el que se basa Android Studio).</p><ul><li>Recibe influencias de <strong>Groovy, Scala y C#</strong>.</li><li>Genera código para la <strong>JVM</strong> (Java Virtual Machine), para <strong>JavaScript</strong> y, en las últimas versiones, <strong>ejecutables nativos</strong>.</li><li>Tiene muchas menos características que Scala, pero es <strong>más familiar</strong> y <strong>compila más rápido</strong>.</li></ul><h3 id=\"historia\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Historia</span></h3><ul><li>Creado en <strong>2010</strong> por JetBrains. Sus IDE estaban escritos en Java, un lenguaje poco conciso, y buscaban algo más moderno.</li><li>Descartaron <strong>Scala</strong> por eficiencia y por ser \"demasiado potente\" para lo que necesitaban.</li><li>Como no querían salir de la JVM, crearon <strong>su propia versión mejorada de Java: Kotlin</strong>.</li><li>Nació para aplicaciones de escritorio, pero hoy es <strong>multiplataforma</strong> y desde <strong>2017</strong> es <strong>lenguaje oficial de Android</strong> (anunciado por Google).</li></ul><h3 id=\"caracter-sticas-principales\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Características principales</span></h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Característica</th><th>Qué aporta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Sintaxis</strong></td><td>Código más simple y fácil de leer que Java.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Control de nulos</strong></td><td>Mecanismo para evitar los famosos <code>NullPointerException</code> de Java.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Curva de aprendizaje</strong></td><td>Muy suave: se parece mucho a Java.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Comunidad</strong></td><td>Muy enfocada al <em>open source</em>: mucha documentación y código libre.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"kotlin-vs-java-de-un-vistazo\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Kotlin vs Java (de un vistazo)</span></h3><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"c\">// Java</span>\n<span class=\"c\">// public final class Persona { private final String nombre; public Persona(String nombre) {...} public String getNombre() {...} }</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Kotlin: lo mismo en una línea (getters generados automáticamente)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">class</span> <span class=\"t\">Persona</span>(<span class=\"k\">val</span> nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span>)</code></pre></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">Empresas como Google, Netflix, Pinterest, Uber, Trello o Coursera usan Kotlin en sus apps.</div></div>", "subs": [{"id": "historia", "titulo": "Historia"}, {"id": "caracter-sticas-principales", "titulo": "Características principales"}, {"id": "kotlin-vs-java-de-un-vistazo", "titulo": "Kotlin vs Java (de un vistazo)"}], "codes": 1, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema3-s2", "titulo": "2. Uso de Logcat en Android Studio", "html": "<p><strong>Logcat</strong> es la herramienta de Android Studio que <strong>vuelca en una consola los mensajes del sistema</strong> al ejecutar una app, incluidos los que escribimos nosotros con la clase <code>Log</code>.</p><ul><li>Se abre en <strong>View → Tool Windows → Logcat</strong>.</li><li>Para usar <code>Log</code> hay que importarla: <code>import android.util.Log</code>.</li></ul><h3 id=\"m-todos-de-la-clase-log\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Métodos de la clase Log</span></h3><p>Todos reciben dos parámetros: la <strong>etiqueta (tag)</strong> de tipo <code>String?</code> y el <strong>mensaje (msg)</strong> de tipo <code>String</code>.</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">import</span> android.util.<span class=\"t\">Log</span>\n\n<span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">v</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Mensaje verbose&quot;</span>)\n<span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Este es un mensaje de debug&quot;</span>)\n<span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">i</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Este es un mensaje de info&quot;</span>)\n<span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">w</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Este es un mensaje de aviso&quot;</span>)\n<span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">e</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Este es un mensaje de error&quot;</span>)</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"prioridades-de-menor-a-mayor\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Prioridades (de menor a mayor)</span></h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Letra</th><th>Nivel</th><th>Método</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>V</td><td>Verbose (la más baja)</td><td><code>Log.v()</code></td></tr><tr><td>D</td><td>Debug</td><td><code>Log.d()</code></td></tr><tr><td>I</td><td>Info</td><td><code>Log.i()</code></td></tr><tr><td>W</td><td>Warning</td><td><code>Log.w()</code></td></tr><tr><td>E</td><td>Error</td><td><code>Log.e()</code></td></tr><tr><td>F</td><td>Fatal</td><td><code>Log.wtf()</code></td></tr><tr><td>S</td><td>Silent (la más alta, nunca imprime nada)</td><td>—</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"filtrar-mensajes\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Filtrar mensajes</span></h3><ul><li>Escribe en el filtro el <strong>paquete</strong> de tu app: <code>package:com.example.miapp</code></li><li>Filtra por prioridad con <code>level:</code>, por ejemplo <code>level:debug</code></li><li>Busca por tu etiqueta con <strong>Ctrl + F</strong> (o filtrando <code>tag:TAG</code>).</li></ul><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">Consejo: <strong>limpia la consola</strong> de Logcat antes de volver a ejecutar para no mezclar mensajes de ejecuciones distintas.</div></div>", "subs": [{"id": "m-todos-de-la-clase-log", "titulo": "Métodos de la clase Log"}, {"id": "prioridades-de-menor-a-mayor", "titulo": "Prioridades (de menor a mayor)"}, {"id": "filtrar-mensajes", "titulo": "Filtrar mensajes"}], "codes": 1, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema3-s3", "titulo": "3. Programación básica en Kotlin", "html": "<h3 id=\"comentarios\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Comentarios</span></h3><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"c\">// Comentario de una línea</span>\n<span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;¡Hola!&quot;</span>)\n\n<span class=\"c\">/* Comentario de bloque:\nLog.d(&quot;TAG&quot;, &quot;primer mensaje&quot;)\nLog.d(&quot;TAG&quot;, &quot;segundo mensaje&quot;) */</span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"variables-var-y-constantes-val\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Variables (<code>var</code>) y constantes (<code>val</code>)</span></h3><ul><li><code>var</code> → <strong>variable</strong>: su valor puede cambiar.</li><li><code>val</code> → <strong>constante</strong>: una vez inicializada <strong>no se puede modificar</strong>. Es la única diferencia con <code>var</code>.</li><li>Si inicializas al declarar, Kotlin <strong>infiere el tipo</strong> (aun así es recomendable indicarlo).</li></ul><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">var</span> nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span>          <span class=\"c\">// declaración</span>\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> edad: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>\nnombre = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Pepe&quot;</span>             <span class=\"c\">// asignación</span>\nedad = <span class=\"n\">25</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> ciudad: <span class=\"t\">String</span> = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Plasencia&quot;</span>   <span class=\"c\">// tipo explícito</span>\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> pais = <span class=\"s\">&quot;España&quot;</span>                <span class=\"c\">// tipo inferido -&gt; String</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> dni: <span class=\"t\">String</span>\ndni = <span class=\"s\">&quot;12345678A&quot;</span>           <span class=\"c\">// se puede asignar UNA vez</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> curso = <span class=\"n\">2</span>               <span class=\"c\">// constante inferida como Int</span>\n<span class=\"c\">// curso = 3                // ERROR: Val cannot be reassigned</span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"imprimir-variables-en-logcat-plantillas-de-string\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Imprimir variables en Logcat (plantillas de String)</span></h3><p>El mensaje de <code>Log</code> es un <code>String</code>. Para otros tipos usamos <code>toString()</code> o, mejor, <strong>plantillas</strong> con <code>$</code>:</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, nombre)\n<span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, edad.<span class=\"f\">toString</span>())\n<span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;La edad es <span class=\"tp\">$edad</span>&quot;</span>)\n<span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;El año que viene tendrá <span class=\"tp\">${edad + 1}</span>&quot;</span>)   <span class=\"c\">// expresiones entre ${ }</span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"tipos-de-datos\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Tipos de datos</span></h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Tipo</th><th>Tamaño</th><th>Rango / precisión</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>Byte</code></td><td>8 bits</td><td>-128 a 127</td></tr><tr><td><code>Short</code></td><td>16 bits</td><td>-32.768 a 32.767</td></tr><tr><td><code>Int</code></td><td>32 bits</td><td>-2.147.483.648 a 2.147.483.647</td></tr><tr><td><code>Long</code></td><td>64 bits</td><td>±9,22 · 10^18</td></tr><tr><td><code>Float</code></td><td>32 bits</td><td>hasta 7 decimales (se escribe con <code>f</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>Double</code></td><td>64 bits</td><td>hasta 16 decimales</td></tr><tr><td><code>Boolean</code></td><td>—</td><td><code>true</code> / <code>false</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>String</code></td><td>—</td><td>cadenas de texto</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">var</span> nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span> = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Pepe&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> edad: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = <span class=\"n\">5</span>\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> precio: <span class=\"t\">Double</span> = <span class=\"n\">15.50</span>\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> altura: <span class=\"t\">Float</span> = <span class=\"n\">1.73f</span>        <span class=\"c\">// Float SIEMPRE con f o F</span>\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> mayorDeEdad: <span class=\"t\">Boolean</span> = <span class=\"k\">true</span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"operadores\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Operadores</span></h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Tipo</th><th>Operadores</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Aritméticos</td><td><code>+  -  *  /  %</code></td></tr><tr><td>Incremento / decremento</td><td><code>++  --</code></td></tr><tr><td>Relacionales</td><td><code>==  !=  &lt;  &gt;  &lt;=  &gt;=</code></td></tr><tr><td>Lógicos</td><td>`&amp;&amp;</td><td></td><td>!`</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">¡Ojo! Dividir dos <code>Int</code> da un <code>Int</code> (<code>7 / 2 = 3</code>). Para decimales usa <code>Double</code>: <code>7 / 2.0 = 3.5</code>.</div></div><h3 id=\"null-safety-seguridad-frente-a-nulos\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Null safety (seguridad frente a nulos)</span></h3><p>En Kotlin <strong>ninguna variable normal puede ser <code>null</code></strong>. Esto da error de compilación:</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">var</span> nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span> = <span class=\"k\">null</span>   <span class=\"c\">// ERROR</span>\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> edad: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = <span class=\"k\">null</span>        <span class=\"c\">// ERROR</span></code></pre></div><p>Para permitir nulos se añade <code>?</code> al tipo (<strong>tipo nullable</strong>):</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">var</span> nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span>? = <span class=\"k\">null</span>  <span class=\"c\">// OK</span>\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> edad: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>? = <span class=\"k\">null</span>       <span class=\"c\">// OK</span></code></pre></div><p>Para operar con un nullable de forma segura usamos <code>?.let { } ?: run { }</code>:</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code>nombre?.let {\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"k\">it</span>)          <span class=\"c\">// se ejecuta si nombre != null (it = nombre)</span>\n} ?: run {\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;La variable nombre no tiene valor o tiene un valor nulo&quot;</span>)\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\"><code>?.</code> es el <strong>operador de llamada segura</strong> y <code>?:</code> es el <strong>operador Elvis</strong> (\"si lo de la izquierda es null, haz lo de la derecha\").</div></div><h3 id=\"funciones\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Funciones</span></h3><ul><li>Se declaran con <code>fun</code>. Por defecto son <strong>públicas</strong>; con <code>private</code> solo se pueden usar dentro de su clase.</li><li>Parámetros: <code>nombre: Tipo</code>, separados por comas.</li><li>Tipo de retorno después de <code>:</code>. Si no devuelve nada el tipo es <code>Unit</code> (se puede omitir).</li><li>Si el cuerpo es una sola expresión se puede escribir con <code>=</code>.</li></ul><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"f\">saludar</span>() {                                   <span class=\"c\">// pública, sin parámetros</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Hola&quot;</span>)\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">private</span> <span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"f\">datosAlumno</span>(nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span>, edad: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>) {   <span class=\"c\">// : Unit implícito</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Nombre: <span class=\"tp\">$nombre</span>&quot;</span>)\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Edad: <span class=\"tp\">$edad</span>&quot;</span>)\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">private</span> <span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"f\">calcularDoble</span>(numero: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>): <span class=\"t\">Int</span> {\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> numero * <span class=\"n\">2</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">private</span> <span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"f\">calcularTriple</span>(numero: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>): <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = numero * <span class=\"n\">3</span>   <span class=\"c\">// función de una sola expresión</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Uso</span>\n<span class=\"f\">saludar</span>()\n<span class=\"f\">datosAlumno</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Pepe&quot;</span>, <span class=\"n\">25</span>)\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> resultado: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = <span class=\"f\">calcularDoble</span>(<span class=\"n\">5</span>)   <span class=\"c\">// 10</span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"clases\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Clases</span></h3><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">class</span> <span class=\"t\">Persona</span>() {\n    <span class=\"c\">// constructores, propiedades y funciones (métodos)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"f\">presentacion</span>() {\n        <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;¡Hola! Me presento&quot;</span>)\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> alumno = <span class=\"t\">Persona</span>()      <span class=\"c\">// instancia (sin &quot;new&quot;)</span>\nalumno.<span class=\"f\">presentacion</span>()</code></pre></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">Los métodos deben ser <strong>públicos</strong> para poder llamarlos desde fuera de la clase.</div></div><h4>Propiedades, getters y setters</h4><p>Kotlin genera <strong>automáticamente</strong> <code>get()</code> y <code>set()</code> de cada propiedad. Podemos personalizarlos (la propiedad debe ser <code>var</code> para tener <code>set</code>). <code>field</code> es el valor real almacenado:</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">class</span> <span class=\"t\">Persona</span>() {\n    <span class=\"k\">var</span> nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span> = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Pepe&quot;</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">get</span>() {\n            <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"s\">&quot;Efectivamente, soy Pepe&quot;</span>\n        }\n\n    <span class=\"k\">var</span> edad: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = <span class=\"n\">25</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">set</span>(<span class=\"k\">value</span>) {\n            <span class=\"k\">field</span> = <span class=\"k\">if</span> (<span class=\"k\">value</span> &gt;= <span class=\"n\">18</span>) <span class=\"k\">value</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"n\">25</span>\n        }\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> persona1 = <span class=\"t\">Persona</span>()\n<span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;¡Hola! Mi nombre es <span class=\"tp\">${persona1.nombre}</span>&quot;</span>)  <span class=\"c\">// ...Efectivamente, soy Pepe</span>\npersona1.edad = <span class=\"n\">50</span>\n<span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;¡Hola! Mi edad es <span class=\"tp\">${persona1.edad}</span>&quot;</span>)      <span class=\"c\">// ...50</span>\npersona1.edad = <span class=\"n\">10</span>\n<span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Edad: <span class=\"tp\">${persona1.edad}</span>&quot;</span>)                  <span class=\"c\">// 25 (el setter lo impide)</span></code></pre></div><h4>Constructores</h4><ul><li><strong>Principal</strong>: va en la cabecera de la clase y <strong>no tiene cuerpo</strong>.</li><li><strong>Secundario</strong>: se declara dentro con <code>constructor</code>, <strong>sí tiene cuerpo</strong> y debe llamar al principal con <code>this(...)</code>.</li></ul><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">class</span> <span class=\"t\">Persona</span>(<span class=\"k\">var</span> nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span>, <span class=\"k\">var</span> edad: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>) {      <span class=\"c\">// constructor principal</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">var</span> telefono: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = <span class=\"n\">111222333</span>\n\n    <span class=\"k\">constructor</span>(nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span>, edad: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>, nuevoTelefono: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>) : <span class=\"k\">this</span>(nombre, edad) {\n        telefono = nuevoTelefono                         <span class=\"c\">// constructor secundario</span>\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> a = <span class=\"t\">Persona</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Pepe&quot;</span>, <span class=\"n\">25</span>)               <span class=\"c\">// usa el principal</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> b = <span class=\"t\">Persona</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Ana&quot;</span>, <span class=\"n\">30</span>, <span class=\"n\">666777888</span>)     <span class=\"c\">// usa el secundario</span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"data-classes\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Data classes</span></h3><p>Clases pensadas para <strong>guardar datos como un paquete</strong>. Generan solas <code>toString()</code>, <code>equals()</code>, <code>copy()</code>…</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">data</span> <span class=\"k\">class</span> <span class=\"t\">DatosPersona</span>(\n    <span class=\"k\">var</span> nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span>,\n    <span class=\"k\">var</span> edad: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>\n)\n\n<span class=\"k\">class</span> <span class=\"t\">Persona</span>(<span class=\"k\">var</span> <span class=\"k\">data</span>: <span class=\"t\">DatosPersona</span>) {\n    <span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"f\">presentacion</span>() {\n        <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Mi nombre es <span class=\"tp\">${data.nombre}</span> y mi edad es <span class=\"tp\">${data.edad}</span>&quot;</span>)\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> datosAlumno = <span class=\"t\">DatosPersona</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Pepe&quot;</span>, <span class=\"n\">26</span>)\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> alumno = <span class=\"t\">Persona</span>(datosAlumno)\nalumno.<span class=\"f\">presentacion</span>()\n<span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, datosAlumno.<span class=\"f\">toString</span>())   <span class=\"c\">// DatosPersona(nombre=Pepe, edad=26)</span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"interfaces\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Interfaces</span></h3><p>Una <strong>interfaz</strong> solo declara las cabeceras de las funciones. La clase que la implementa (<code>: Interfaz</code>) está <strong>obligada</strong> a implementarlas con <code>override</code>.</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">interface</span> <span class=\"t\">InterfazPersona</span> {\n    <span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"f\">mostrarEdad</span>()\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">class</span> <span class=\"t\">Persona</span>(<span class=\"k\">private</span> <span class=\"k\">val</span> nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span>, <span class=\"k\">private</span> <span class=\"k\">val</span> edad: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>) : <span class=\"t\">InterfazPersona</span> {\n    <span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"f\">presentacion</span>() {\n        <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;¡Hola! Mi nombre es <span class=\"tp\">$nombre</span> y mi edad es <span class=\"tp\">$edad</span>&quot;</span>)\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"k\">override</span> <span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"f\">mostrarEdad</span>() {\n        <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Tengo <span class=\"tp\">$edad</span> años&quot;</span>)\n    }\n}</code></pre></div>", "subs": [{"id": "comentarios", "titulo": "Comentarios"}, {"id": "variables-var-y-constantes-val", "titulo": "Variables (`var`) y constantes (`val`)"}, {"id": "imprimir-variables-en-logcat-plantillas-de-string", "titulo": "Imprimir variables en Logcat (plantillas de String)"}, {"id": "tipos-de-datos", "titulo": "Tipos de datos"}, {"id": "operadores", "titulo": "Operadores"}, {"id": "null-safety-seguridad-frente-a-nulos", "titulo": "Null safety (seguridad frente a nulos)"}, {"id": "funciones", "titulo": "Funciones"}, {"id": "clases", "titulo": "Clases"}, {"id": "data-classes", "titulo": "Data classes"}, {"id": "interfaces", "titulo": "Interfaces"}], "codes": 13, "tables": 2}, {"id": "tema3-s4", "titulo": "4. Colecciones", "html": "<p>Un <strong>listado</strong> es un conjunto <strong>ordenado</strong> de valores del <strong>mismo tipo</strong>; cada elemento tiene un <strong>índice</strong> (empieza en 0).</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Tipo</th><th>Mutabilidad</th><th>Se crea con</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>List</code></td><td><strong>Inmutable</strong>: no se puede modificar</td><td><code>listOf()</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>ArrayList</code></td><td><strong>Mutable</strong>: añadir, modificar, borrar, ordenar…</td><td><code>arrayListOf()</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"list-inmutable\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>List (inmutable)</span></h3><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">var</span> list: <span class=\"t\">List</span>&lt;<span class=\"t\">String</span>&gt; = <span class=\"f\">listOf</span>()                  <span class=\"c\">// vacía, indicando el tipo de listado</span>\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> list2 = listOf&lt;<span class=\"t\">String</span>&gt;()                       <span class=\"c\">// vacía, indicando el tipo de valores</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> numeros: <span class=\"t\">List</span>&lt;<span class=\"t\">String</span>&gt; = <span class=\"f\">listOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Uno&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Dos&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Tres&quot;</span>)\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> numeros2 = listOf&lt;<span class=\"t\">String</span>&gt;(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Uno&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Dos&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Tres&quot;</span>)\n\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> valor: <span class=\"t\">String</span> = numeros[<span class=\"n\">0</span>]          <span class=\"c\">// &quot;Uno&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> valor2: <span class=\"t\">String</span> = numeros.<span class=\"k\">get</span>(<span class=\"n\">1</span>)     <span class=\"c\">// &quot;Dos&quot;</span>\n\nnumeros.size              <span class=\"c\">// 3</span>\nnumeros.<span class=\"f\">indexOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Dos&quot;</span>)    <span class=\"c\">// 1</span>\nnumeros.<span class=\"f\">contains</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Tres&quot;</span>)  <span class=\"c\">// true</span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"arraylist-mutable\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>ArrayList (mutable)</span></h3><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">var</span> arrayList: <span class=\"t\">ArrayList</span>&lt;<span class=\"t\">String</span>&gt; = <span class=\"f\">arrayListOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Uno&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Dos&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Tres&quot;</span>)\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> vacio = arrayListOf&lt;<span class=\"t\">String</span>&gt;()\n\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> v: <span class=\"t\">String</span> = arrayList[<span class=\"n\">0</span>]            <span class=\"c\">// leer por índice</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> v2: <span class=\"t\">String</span> = arrayList.<span class=\"k\">get</span>(<span class=\"n\">0</span>)\n\narrayList[<span class=\"n\">0</span>] = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Cero&quot;</span>                   <span class=\"c\">// modificar por índice</span>\narrayList.<span class=\"f\">add</span>(<span class=\"n\">0</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Inicio&quot;</span>)              <span class=\"c\">// insertar en una posición</span>\narrayList.<span class=\"f\">add</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Final&quot;</span>)                  <span class=\"c\">// añadir al final</span>\narrayList.<span class=\"k\">set</span>(<span class=\"n\">1</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Uno bis&quot;</span>)             <span class=\"c\">// modificar con set</span>\narrayList.<span class=\"f\">remove</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Dos&quot;</span>)                 <span class=\"c\">// eliminar por valor</span>\narrayList.<span class=\"f\">removeAt</span>(<span class=\"n\">0</span>)                   <span class=\"c\">// eliminar por posición</span>\narrayList.<span class=\"f\">isEmpty</span>()                     <span class=\"c\">// false</span>\narrayList.<span class=\"f\">contains</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Tres&quot;</span>)              <span class=\"c\">// true</span>\narrayList.size\narrayList.<span class=\"f\">sort</span>()                        <span class=\"c\">// ordenar</span></code></pre></div>", "subs": [{"id": "list-inmutable", "titulo": "List (inmutable)"}, {"id": "arraylist-mutable", "titulo": "ArrayList (mutable)"}], "codes": 2, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema3-s5", "titulo": "5. Estructuras de control", "html": "<h3 id=\"condicionales\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Condicionales</span></h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Tipo</th><th>Palabra reservada</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Simple</td><td><code>if</code></td></tr><tr><td>Doble</td><td><code>if … else</code></td></tr><tr><td>Múltiple</td><td><code>when</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"c\">// Simple (si solo hay una sentencia, las llaves son opcionales)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> (edad &gt;= <span class=\"n\">18</span>) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Es mayor de edad&quot;</span>)\n}\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Doble</span>\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> (lenguaje == <span class=\"s\">&quot;Kotlin&quot;</span>) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;El lenguaje de programación elegido es Kotlin&quot;</span>)\n} <span class=\"k\">else</span> {\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;El lenguaje de programación no es Kotlin&quot;</span>)\n}\n\n<span class=\"c\">// if como expresión: su resultado se asigna a una variable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> edad: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = <span class=\"n\">25</span>\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> esMayorDeEdad: <span class=\"t\">Boolean</span> = <span class=\"k\">if</span> (edad &gt;= <span class=\"n\">18</span>) {\n    <span class=\"k\">true</span>\n} <span class=\"k\">else</span> {\n    <span class=\"k\">false</span>\n}</code></pre></div><h4>when (la \"navaja suiza\", más potente que el switch de Java)</h4><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">var</span> lenguaje: <span class=\"t\">String</span> = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Kotlin&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">when</span> (lenguaje) {\n    <span class=\"s\">&quot;Kotlin&quot;</span> -&gt; {\n        <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Se ha seleccionado Kotlin&quot;</span>)      <span class=\"c\">// varias sentencias -&gt; llaves</span>\n        <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Esta es su primera opción&quot;</span>)\n    }\n    <span class=\"s\">&quot;Java&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Scala&quot;</span> -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Lenguaje de la JVM&quot;</span>)   <span class=\"c\">// varios valores</span>\n    <span class=\"s\">&quot;Python&quot;</span> -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Se ha seleccionado Python&quot;</span>)\n    <span class=\"k\">else</span> -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Se ha seleccionado otro lenguaje&quot;</span>)\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> numero: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = <span class=\"n\">10</span>\n<span class=\"k\">when</span> (numero) {\n    <span class=\"n\">0</span> -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;El número es 0&quot;</span>)\n    <span class=\"n\">1</span> -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;El número es 1&quot;</span>)\n    <span class=\"k\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">5</span>..<span class=\"n\">15</span> -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;El número está entre 5 y 15&quot;</span>)   <span class=\"c\">// rangos</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">when</span> {                                       <span class=\"c\">// when sin argumento = cadena de if</span>\n    numero == <span class=\"n\">0</span> -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;El número es 0&quot;</span>)\n    numero &gt; <span class=\"n\">1</span> -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;El número es mayor que 1&quot;</span>)\n    numero <span class=\"k\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">5</span>..<span class=\"n\">15</span> -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;El número está entre 5 y 15&quot;</span>)\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">En <code>when</code> solo se ejecuta la <strong>primera</strong> rama que cumple la condición.</div></div><h3 id=\"estructuras-repetitivas-bucles\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Estructuras repetitivas (bucles)</span></h3><h4>for</h4><p>Se usa cuando el número de repeticiones es <strong>conocido</strong>.</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">val</span> arrayList = <span class=\"f\">arrayListOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Ana&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Luis&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Marta&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Pedro&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Sara&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Juan&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Eva&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Iván&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Lola&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Raúl&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Noa&quot;</span>)\n\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> (nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span> <span class=\"k\">in</span> arrayList) {                  <span class=\"c\">// &quot;for-each&quot;: recorre los elementos</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Nombre: <span class=\"tp\">$nombre</span>&quot;</span>)\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> (position: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> <span class=\"k\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">0</span>..<span class=\"n\">5</span>) {                        <span class=\"c\">// intervalo cerrado: 0,1,2,3,4,5</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Nombre: <span class=\"tp\">${arrayList.get(position)}</span>&quot;</span>)\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> (position: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> <span class=\"k\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">0</span> <span class=\"k\">until</span> arrayList.size) {      <span class=\"c\">// until: hasta size - 1 (evita salirse)</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Nombre: <span class=\"tp\">${arrayList[position]}</span>&quot;</span>)\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> (position: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> <span class=\"k\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">0</span>..<span class=\"n\">10</span> <span class=\"k\">step</span> <span class=\"n\">2</span>) {                <span class=\"c\">// de 2 en 2: 0,2,4,6,8,10</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Nombre: <span class=\"tp\">${arrayList[position]}</span>&quot;</span>)\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> (position: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> <span class=\"k\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">10</span> <span class=\"k\">downTo</span> <span class=\"n\">0</span>) {                 <span class=\"c\">// hacia atrás: 10,9,...,0</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Nombre: <span class=\"tp\">${arrayList[position]}</span>&quot;</span>)\n}</code></pre></div><h4>while y do-while</h4><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">var</span> numero: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = <span class=\"n\">1</span>\n<span class=\"k\">while</span> (numero &lt;= <span class=\"n\">10</span>) {          <span class=\"c\">// 0 o más veces</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Número: <span class=\"tp\">$numero</span>&quot;</span>)\n    numero++\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> n: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = <span class=\"n\">1</span>\n<span class=\"k\">do</span> {                            <span class=\"c\">// al menos 1 vez</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Número: <span class=\"tp\">$n</span>&quot;</span>)\n    n++\n} <span class=\"k\">while</span> (n &lt;= <span class=\"n\">10</span>)</code></pre></div>", "subs": [{"id": "condicionales", "titulo": "Condicionales"}, {"id": "estructuras-repetitivas-bucles", "titulo": "Estructuras repetitivas (bucles)"}], "codes": 4, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema3-s6", "titulo": "6. Lambdas y funciones de orden superior", "html": "<h3 id=\"lambdas\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Lambdas</span></h3><p>Una <strong>lambda</strong> es una función corta escrita <strong>entre llaves</strong> que se puede guardar en una variable o pasar como argumento.</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code>{ numero -&gt; numero * <span class=\"n\">2</span> }                                  <span class=\"c\">// recibe un número y devuelve su doble</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> doble: (<span class=\"t\">Int</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = { numero -&gt; numero * <span class=\"n\">2</span> }        <span class=\"c\">// tipo a la izquierda…</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> doble2 = { numero: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> -&gt; numero * <span class=\"n\">2</span> }                <span class=\"c\">// …o en el parámetro</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> resultado: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = <span class=\"f\">doble</span>(<span class=\"n\">5</span>)                             <span class=\"c\">// 10</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Con un único parámetro se puede usar &quot;it&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> triple: (<span class=\"t\">Int</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = { <span class=\"k\">it</span> * <span class=\"n\">3</span> }</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"funciones-de-orden-superior\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Funciones de orden superior</span></h3><p>Reciben (o devuelven) otra función. Se usan muchísimo con colecciones:</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">val</span> numeros: <span class=\"t\">List</span>&lt;<span class=\"t\">Int</span>&gt; = <span class=\"f\">listOf</span>(<span class=\"n\">1</span>, <span class=\"n\">2</span>, <span class=\"n\">3</span>, <span class=\"n\">4</span>, <span class=\"n\">5</span>)\n\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> pares: <span class=\"t\">List</span>&lt;<span class=\"t\">Int</span>&gt; = numeros.filter { <span class=\"k\">it</span> % <span class=\"n\">2</span> == <span class=\"n\">0</span> }     <span class=\"c\">// [2, 4]       -&gt; filtrar varios</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> primero: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>? = numeros.find { <span class=\"k\">it</span> &gt; <span class=\"n\">3</span> }               <span class=\"c\">// 4 (o null)   -&gt; buscar uno</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> dobles: <span class=\"t\">List</span>&lt;<span class=\"t\">Int</span>&gt; = numeros.map { <span class=\"k\">it</span> * <span class=\"n\">2</span> }            <span class=\"c\">// [2,4,6,8,10] -&gt; transformar</span>\nnumeros.forEach { <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Número: <span class=\"tp\">$it</span>&quot;</span>) }           <span class=\"c\">// recorrer</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Encadenadas: cada una trabaja con el resultado de la anterior</span>\nnumeros.filter { <span class=\"k\">it</span> &gt; <span class=\"n\">2</span> }.map { <span class=\"k\">it</span> * <span class=\"n\">2</span> }.forEach { <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;<span class=\"tp\">$it</span>&quot;</span>) }   <span class=\"c\">// 6, 8, 10</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Función</th><th>Devuelve</th><th>Para qué</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>filter { }</code></td><td><code>List</code></td><td>Elementos que cumplen la condición</td></tr><tr><td><code>find { }</code></td><td>Elemento o <code>null</code></td><td>El <strong>primero</strong> que cumple la condición</td></tr><tr><td><code>map { }</code></td><td><code>List</code></td><td>Nueva lista transformando cada elemento</td></tr><tr><td><code>forEach { }</code></td><td><code>Unit</code></td><td>Ejecutar una acción por cada elemento</td></tr></tbody></table></div>", "subs": [{"id": "lambdas", "titulo": "Lambdas"}, {"id": "funciones-de-orden-superior", "titulo": "Funciones de orden superior"}], "codes": 2, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema3-s7", "titulo": "7. Control de errores", "html": "<p>El <strong>control de excepciones</strong> permite gestionar los errores que ocurren <strong>en tiempo de ejecución</strong> sin que la app se cierre.</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">try</span> {\n    <span class=\"c\">// Sentencia(s) que queremos proteger</span>\n} <span class=\"k\">catch</span> (e1: <span class=\"t\">Excepcion1</span>) {\n    <span class=\"c\">// Control de la excepción 1</span>\n} <span class=\"k\">catch</span> (e2: <span class=\"t\">Excepcion2</span>) {\n    <span class=\"c\">// Control de la excepción 2</span>\n} <span class=\"k\">finally</span> {\n    <span class=\"c\">// OPCIONAL: se ejecuta SIEMPRE (haya error o no)</span>\n}</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ejemplo-indexoutofboundsexception\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Ejemplo: IndexOutOfBoundsException</span></h3><p>Si recorremos el listado <strong>hasta su tamaño</strong> (con <code>..</code>) intentamos acceder a un índice que no existe:</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">val</span> nombres: <span class=\"t\">ArrayList</span>&lt;<span class=\"t\">String</span>&gt; = <span class=\"f\">arrayListOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Ana&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Luis&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Marta&quot;</span>)\n\n<span class=\"k\">try</span> {\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> (i: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> <span class=\"k\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">0</span>..nombres.size) {          <span class=\"c\">// 0..3 -&gt; el índice 3 NO existe</span>\n        <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Nombre: <span class=\"tp\">${nombres[i]}</span>&quot;</span>)\n    }\n} <span class=\"k\">catch</span> (e: <span class=\"t\">IndexOutOfBoundsException</span>) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">e</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Error: te has salido del listado -&gt; <span class=\"tp\">${e.message}</span>&quot;</span>)\n} <span class=\"k\">finally</span> {\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">d</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Fin del recorrido&quot;</span>)\n}</code></pre></div><p>Otros ejemplos habituales:</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">try</span> {\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> numero: <span class=\"t\">Int</span> = <span class=\"s\">&quot;abc&quot;</span>.<span class=\"f\">toInt</span>()            <span class=\"c\">// NumberFormatException</span>\n} <span class=\"k\">catch</span> (e: <span class=\"t\">NumberFormatException</span>) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">e</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;El texto no es un número&quot;</span>)\n}\n\n<span class=\"k\">try</span> {\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> r = <span class=\"n\">10</span> / <span class=\"n\">0</span>                             <span class=\"c\">// ArithmeticException</span>\n} <span class=\"k\">catch</span> (e: <span class=\"t\">ArithmeticException</span>) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">e</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;No se puede dividir entre 0&quot;</span>)\n} <span class=\"k\">catch</span> (e: <span class=\"t\">Exception</span>) {                       <span class=\"c\">// captura cualquier otra</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Log</span>.<span class=\"f\">e</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TAG&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Error inesperado: <span class=\"tp\">${e.message}</span>&quot;</span>)\n}</code></pre></div>", "subs": [{"id": "ejemplo-indexoutofboundsexception", "titulo": "Ejemplo: IndexOutOfBoundsException"}], "codes": 3, "tables": 0}]}, {"id": "tema4", "numero": 4, "titulo": "Primer contacto con el código. Ciclo de vida de una App", "resumen": "Componentes de una app Android, la Activity y Jetpack Compose, ciclo de vida, recursos (strings, imágenes) e idiomas.", "badge": "Android OS & Lifecycle", "tech": "android", "icon": "android", "secciones": [{"id": "tema4-s1", "titulo": "1. Componentes de una aplicación Android", "html": "<p>Una app Android se construye combinando varios <strong>componentes</strong>. Los principales son:</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Componente</th><th>Qué es</th><th>Ejemplo</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Activity</strong></td><td>Punto de entrada y contenedor de la interfaz de usuario. Con Jetpack Compose se suele usar <strong>una única Activity</strong> con todas las pantallas.</td><td><code>MainActivity</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Composable</strong></td><td>Función que describe una parte de la interfaz. Se combinan para formar pantallas.</td><td><code>Text</code>, <code>Button</code>, <code>Image</code>, <code>Column</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Service</strong></td><td>Realiza operaciones <strong>sin interfaz</strong>, normalmente en segundo plano.</td><td>Reproducir música, notificaciones, subir/descargar archivos</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Content Provider</strong></td><td>Permite <strong>compartir datos entre apps</strong> de forma controlada.</td><td>Leer los contactos del móvil (con permisos)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Broadcast Receiver</strong></td><td>Recibe y responde a <strong>eventos globales</strong> del sistema u otras apps.</td><td>Batería baja, cambio de red, modo avión</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Widget</strong></td><td>Elemento visual de la app que se muestra <strong>fuera de ella</strong> (p. ej. pantalla de inicio).</td><td>Reloj, clima, calendario, notas</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Intent</strong></td><td>Mensaje para pedir al sistema que <strong>otra app realice una acción</strong>.</td><td>Abrir una web, llamar, ver un mapa, enviar un email</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"intents-aprovechar-otras-apps\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Intents: aprovechar otras apps</span></h3><p>Si nuestra app necesita abrir una web <strong>no hace falta programar un navegador</strong>: enviamos un <em>Intent</em> y Android busca una app instalada capaz de hacerlo. Para el usuario parece que todo forma parte de nuestra app.</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"c\">// Ejemplo: abrir una página web con un Intent</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> intent = <span class=\"t\">Intent</span>(<span class=\"t\">Intent</span>.<span class=\"t\">ACTION_VIEW</span>, <span class=\"t\">Uri</span>.<span class=\"f\">parse</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;https://developer.android.com&quot;</span>))\n<span class=\"f\">startActivity</span>(intent)</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"no-hay-funci-n-main\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>No hay función main()</span></h3><ul><li>Las apps Android <strong>no tienen un punto de entrada único</strong> (<code>main()</code>).</li><li>Cada app se ejecuta en un <strong>proceso independiente con permisos restringidos</strong>: no puede activar directamente componentes de otra app; lo hace <strong>el sistema operativo</strong>.</li><li>Al abrir una app, el sistema inicia la <strong>Activity</strong> que actúa como punto de entrada (declarada en el <code>AndroidManifest.xml</code>).</li></ul><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"xml\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-and\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#3DDC84\" d=\"M17.6 11.48 L19.44 8.3 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 -0.63 l-1.88 3.24 a11.43 11.43 0 0 0 -8.94 0 L5.65 7.67 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 0.63 L6.4 11.48 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 1 20 h22 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 17.6 11.48 Z M7 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 8.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 7 17.25 Z M17 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 18.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 17 17.25 Z\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">ANDROID XML</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">&lt;activity</span>\n    <span class=\"a\">android:name</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;.MainActivity&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"a\">android:exported</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;true&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"a\">android:theme</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;@style/Theme.MiApp&quot;</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">&lt;intent-filter</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"c\">&lt;!-- Esto la convierte en la Activity de entrada (icono del launcher) --&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">&lt;action</span> <span class=\"a\">android:name</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;android.intent.action.MAIN&quot;</span> <span class=\"k\">/&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">&lt;category</span> <span class=\"a\">android:name</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;android.intent.category.LAUNCHER&quot;</span> <span class=\"k\">/&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">&lt;/intent-filter</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">&lt;/activity</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">Más información: <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/manifest-intro?hl=es-419\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Manifiesto de la app</a></div></div>", "subs": [{"id": "intents-aprovechar-otras-apps", "titulo": "Intents: aprovechar otras apps"}, {"id": "no-hay-funci-n-main", "titulo": "No hay función main()"}], "codes": 2, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema4-s2", "titulo": "2. El componente Activity", "html": "<p>La <strong>Activity</strong> es el componente fundamental: proporciona la <strong>ventana</strong> donde se muestra la interfaz y es el <strong>punto de entrada</strong> de la app.</p><ul><li>La actividad principal suele llamarse <strong><code>MainActivity</code></strong>.</li><li>Hereda de <strong><code>ComponentActivity</code></strong>.</li><li>Android ejecuta <strong><code>onCreate()</code></strong> al iniciar la actividad. Dentro, <strong><code>setContent { }</code></strong> establece la interfaz hecha con Jetpack Compose.</li></ul><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">app/src/main/java/com/example/miapp/MainActivity.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">package</span> com.example.miapp\n\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> android.os.<span class=\"t\">Bundle</span>\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.activity.<span class=\"t\">ComponentActivity</span>\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.activity.compose.setContent\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.activity.enableEdgeToEdge\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.material3.<span class=\"t\">Text</span>\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.res.stringResource\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> com.example.miapp.ui.theme.<span class=\"t\">MiAppTheme</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">class</span> <span class=\"t\">MainActivity</span> : <span class=\"t\">ComponentActivity</span>() {          <span class=\"c\">// hereda de ComponentActivity</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">override</span> <span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"f\">onCreate</span>(savedInstanceState: <span class=\"t\">Bundle</span>?) {\n        <span class=\"k\">super</span>.<span class=\"f\">onCreate</span>(savedInstanceState)\n        <span class=\"f\">enableEdgeToEdge</span>()\n        setContent {                                <span class=\"c\">// aquí va la interfaz (Compose)</span>\n            <span class=\"t\">MiAppTheme</span> {\n                <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"f\">stringResource</span>(R.string.saludo))   <span class=\"c\">// texto en strings.xml</span>\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"single-activity-architecture\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Single-Activity Architecture</span></h3><ul><li><strong>Modelo tradicional (XML)</strong>: cada pantalla solía ser una Activity distinta.</li><li><strong>Jetpack Compose</strong>: <strong>una sola Activity</strong> contiene varias pantallas hechas con funciones Composable. La <strong>navegación</strong> cambia entre ellas.</li><li>Por tanto, <strong>cambiar de pantalla no significa cambiar de Activity</strong>.</li></ul><h3 id=\"la-pila-de-navegaci-n\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>La pila de navegación</span></h3><ol><li>Al iniciar, se muestra la pantalla que está en la <strong>cima</strong> de la pila.</li><li>Al navegar a otra pantalla, esta se <strong>apila</strong> encima y pasa a mostrarse; la anterior queda debajo.</li><li>Al pulsar <strong>\"atrás\"</strong> se <strong>desapila</strong> la de arriba y vuelve a verse la anterior.</li></ol><div class=\"code logcat\" data-lang=\"text\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-log\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3DDC84\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3DDC84\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M7 9l3 3-3 3M12 15h5\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Consola / Diagrama</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">ESQUEMA</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code>navegar a B        navegar a C        pulsar &quot;atrás&quot;\n┌───┐              ┌───┐              ┌───┐\n│ B │ ← visible    │ C │ ← visible    │ B │ ← visible\n│ A │              │ B │              │ A │\n└───┘              │ A │              └───┘\n                   └───┘</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"d-nde-est-cada-cosa-en-el-proyecto\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>¿Dónde está cada cosa en el proyecto?</span></h3><div class=\"tree\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#F88909\" d=\"M10 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-8l-2-2z\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Estructura del proyecto Android</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">PROYECTO</span></div></div><pre>app/\n├── manifests/AndroidManifest.xml\n├── java/com/example/miapp/   (Project → app → src → main → java → paquete)\n│   ├── MainActivity.kt       ← funciones Composable + lógica de la Activity\n│   └── ui/theme/\n│       ├── Color.kt\n│       ├── Theme.kt\n│       └── Type.kt\n└── res/\n    ├── drawable/             ← imágenes (.png, .jpg, .xml vectoriales)\n    ├── values/strings.xml    ← textos de la app\n    └── values-es/strings.xml ← traducción al castellano (si la hay)</pre></div><h3 id=\"unidades-de-medida\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Unidades de medida</span></h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Unidad</th><th>Uso</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>dp</strong> (density-independent pixels)</td><td>Tamaños y dimensiones de los elementos (<code>16.dp</code>).</td></tr><tr><td><strong>sp</strong> (scale-independent pixels)</td><td><strong>Tamaño de texto</strong> (<code>60.sp</code>); respeta el tamaño de fuente elegido por el usuario.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>px</strong> (píxeles físicos)</td><td>No se recomienda usarlos directamente.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">En Jetpack Compose usaremos principalmente <strong>dp</strong> y <strong>sp</strong> (<code>import androidx.compose.ui.unit.dp</code> / <code>sp</code>).</div></div>", "subs": [{"id": "single-activity-architecture", "titulo": "Single-Activity Architecture"}, {"id": "la-pila-de-navegaci-n", "titulo": "La pila de navegación"}, {"id": "d-nde-est-cada-cosa-en-el-proyecto", "titulo": "¿Dónde está cada cosa en el proyecto?"}, {"id": "unidades-de-medida", "titulo": "Unidades de medida"}], "codes": 2, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema4-s3", "titulo": "3. Ciclo de vida de una Activity", "html": "<p>Una Activity pasa por distintos <strong>estados</strong> desde que Android la crea hasta que la destruye. Al conjunto de estados y transiciones se le llama <strong>ciclo de vida</strong>.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Estado</th><th>¿En memoria?</th><th>¿Visible (UI)?</th><th>¿Primer plano?</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Inexistente</strong></td><td>No</td><td>No</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Detenida</strong></td><td>Sí</td><td>No</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pausada</strong></td><td>Sí</td><td>Parcialmente</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td><strong>En marcha</strong></td><td>Sí</td><td>Sí</td><td>Sí (el usuario interactúa)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"m-todos-del-ciclo-de-vida\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Métodos del ciclo de vida</span></h3><div class=\"code logcat\" data-lang=\"text\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-log\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3DDC84\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3DDC84\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M7 9l3 3-3 3M12 15h5\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Consola / Diagrama</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">ESQUEMA</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code>          ┌──────────── onRestart() ◄──────────┐\n          ▼                                    │\nonCreate() → onStart() → onResume() → [EN MARCHA] → onPause() → onStop() → onDestroy()\n                             ▲                          │\n                             └──────────────────────────┘ (vuelve a primer plano)</code></pre></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Método</th><th>Cuándo se ejecuta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>onCreate()</code></td><td>Al crear la instancia de la Activity. Tareas iniciales; con Compose aquí va <code>setContent</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>onStart()</code></td><td>La Activity empieza a ser <strong>visible</strong> (raramente se usa).</td></tr><tr><td><code>onResume()</code></td><td>Pasa a <strong>primer plano</strong> y empieza a interactuar con el usuario → <strong>En marcha</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>onPause()</code></td><td>Deja el primer plano → <strong>Pausada</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>onStop()</code></td><td>Deja de ser visible → <strong>Detenida</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>onDestroy()</code></td><td>Justo antes de <strong>destruir</strong> la instancia.</td></tr><tr><td><code>onRestart()</code></td><td>Una Activity <strong>detenida</strong> vuelve a iniciarse.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>Todos son <strong>opcionales</strong>: los sobrescribimos con <code>override</code> solo si los necesitamos y <strong>siempre llamando a <code>super</code></strong>.</li><li>Aunque no los escribamos <strong>siguen existiendo</strong> en la clase Activity (simplemente están \"vacíos\").</li></ul><h3 id=\"para-qu-sirve\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>¿Para qué sirve?</span></h3><ul><li>Iniciar/detener tareas al pasar a primer o segundo plano.</li><li>Pausar recursos que no se necesitan cuando la app no se ve (cámara, sensores, música…).</li><li>Liberar recursos cuando la Activity deja de usarse.</li><li>Prepararse para cambios de configuración (por ejemplo, <strong>girar la pantalla</strong> destruye y recrea la Activity).</li><li>Detectar cuándo la app vuelve a estar disponible.</li></ul><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">Vídeo recomendado: <a href=\"https://youtu.be/E1vAobJ8Fxo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ciclo de vida de una aplicación en Android</a></div></div>", "subs": [{"id": "m-todos-del-ciclo-de-vida", "titulo": "Métodos del ciclo de vida"}, {"id": "para-qu-sirve", "titulo": "¿Para qué sirve?"}], "codes": 1, "tables": 2}, {"id": "tema4-s4", "titulo": "4. Acceso a recursos", "html": "<p>Al crear recursos, Android genera automáticamente la clase <strong><code>R</code></strong>, que contiene los <strong>identificadores (ID)</strong> de todo lo que hay en <code>res/</code>. <code>R</code> no guarda el contenido, solo el ID para acceder a él.</p><ul><li>Textos → <code>res/values/strings.xml</code></li><li>Imágenes → <code>res/drawable/</code></li></ul><h3 id=\"formato-del-id\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Formato del ID</span></h3><p><code>R.&lt;tipo&gt;.&lt;nombre&gt;</code> → por ejemplo <strong><code>R.string.saludo</code></strong> (texto) o <strong><code>R.drawable.logo</code></strong> (imagen).</p><h3 id=\"stringresource-y-painterresource\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>stringResource() y painterResource()</span></h3><div class=\"tabs\"><div class=\"tab-heads\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab active\" data-i=\"0\" title=\"app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-and\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#3DDC84\" d=\"M17.6 11.48 L19.44 8.3 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 -0.63 l-1.88 3.24 a11.43 11.43 0 0 0 -8.94 0 L5.65 7.67 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 0.63 L6.4 11.48 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 1 20 h22 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 17.6 11.48 Z M7 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 8.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 7 17.25 Z M17 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 18.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 17 17.25 Z\"/></svg><span>strings.xml</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"1\" title=\"MainActivity.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>MainActivity.kt</span></button></div><div class=\"tab-body active\" data-i=\"0\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"xml\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-and\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#3DDC84\" d=\"M17.6 11.48 L19.44 8.3 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 -0.63 l-1.88 3.24 a11.43 11.43 0 0 0 -8.94 0 L5.65 7.67 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 0.63 L6.4 11.48 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 1 20 h22 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 17.6 11.48 Z M7 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 8.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 7 17.25 Z M17 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 18.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 17 17.25 Z\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">ANDROID XML</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">&lt;resources</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">&lt;string</span> <span class=\"a\">name</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;app_name&quot;</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>MiApp<span class=\"k\">&lt;/string</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">&lt;string</span> <span class=\"a\">name</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;saludo&quot;</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>¡Hola!<span class=\"k\">&lt;/string</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">&lt;string</span> <span class=\"a\">name</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;desc_logo&quot;</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>Logotipo de la app<span class=\"k\">&lt;/string</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">&lt;/resources</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"1\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">MainActivity.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">Cabecera</span>() {\n    <span class=\"t\">Column</span> {\n        <span class=\"c\">// Texto desde strings.xml</span>\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(text = <span class=\"f\">stringResource</span>(id = R.string.saludo))\n\n        <span class=\"c\">// Imagen desde res/drawable/logo.png</span>\n        <span class=\"t\">Image</span>(\n            painter = <span class=\"f\">painterResource</span>(id = R.drawable.logo),\n            contentDescription = <span class=\"f\">stringResource</span>(id = R.string.desc_logo)\n        )\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">Reglas de nombres de recursos: <strong>minúsculas, números y guion bajo</strong> (<code>fondo_principal.png</code>). Nada de espacios, mayúsculas, guiones ni tildes.</div></div><h3 id=\"buenas-pr-cticas-todos-los-textos-en-strings-xml\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Buenas prácticas: todos los textos en strings.xml</span></h3><p>El profesor lo exige y es lo correcto: <strong>ningún texto visible para el usuario se escribe \"a mano\" en el código</strong>. Así se puede traducir la app, cambiar un texto sin tocar el código y reutilizarlo.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Caso</th><th>Cómo se hace</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Texto en un Composable</td><td><code>Text(stringResource(R.string.titulo))</code></td></tr><tr><td>Texto con datos variables</td><td><code>&lt;string name=\"saludo\"&gt;Hola, %1$s&lt;/string&gt;</code> → <code>stringResource(R.string.saludo, nombre)</code></td></tr><tr><td>Varios datos</td><td><code>%1$s</code> (texto), <code>%1$d</code> (entero), <code>%2$s</code>… → <code>stringResource(R.string.x, a, b)</code></td></tr><tr><td>Fuera de un Composable (funciones, <code>onClick</code>, Toast)</td><td><code>context.getString(R.string.x)</code> o <code>context.getString(R.string.x, dato)</code></td></tr><tr><td>Toast</td><td><code>Toast.makeText(context, R.string.mensaje, Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()</code> (acepta el ID directamente)</td></tr><tr><td>Lista de textos</td><td><code>&lt;string-array&gt;</code> en <code>strings.xml</code> → <code>stringArrayResource(R.array.nombre)</code></td></tr><tr><td>Data class con textos fijos</td><td>Guarda el <strong>ID</strong>: <code>@StringRes val nombre: Int</code> y muéstralo con <code>stringResource(item.nombre)</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>contentDescription</code> de imágenes</td><td>También en <code>strings.xml</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tabs\"><div class=\"tab-heads\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab active\" data-i=\"0\" title=\"app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-and\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#3DDC84\" d=\"M17.6 11.48 L19.44 8.3 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 -0.63 l-1.88 3.24 a11.43 11.43 0 0 0 -8.94 0 L5.65 7.67 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 0.63 L6.4 11.48 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 1 20 h22 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 17.6 11.48 Z M7 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 8.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 7 17.25 Z M17 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 18.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 17 17.25 Z\"/></svg><span>strings.xml</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"1\" title=\"MainActivity.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>MainActivity.kt</span></button></div><div class=\"tab-body active\" data-i=\"0\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"xml\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-and\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#3DDC84\" d=\"M17.6 11.48 L19.44 8.3 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 -0.63 l-1.88 3.24 a11.43 11.43 0 0 0 -8.94 0 L5.65 7.67 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 0.63 L6.4 11.48 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 1 20 h22 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 17.6 11.48 Z M7 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 8.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 7 17.25 Z M17 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 18.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 17 17.25 Z\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">ANDROID XML</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">&lt;resources</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">&lt;string</span> <span class=\"a\">name</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;app_name&quot;</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>MiApp<span class=\"k\">&lt;/string</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"c\">&lt;!-- Texto simple --&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">&lt;string</span> <span class=\"a\">name</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;titulo&quot;</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>Mi primera app<span class=\"k\">&lt;/string</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"c\">&lt;!-- Con parámetros: %1$s = 1er argumento (texto), %2$d = 2º argumento (entero) --&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">&lt;string</span> <span class=\"a\">name</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;bienvenida&quot;</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>Hola %1$s, tienes %2$d mensajes<span class=\"k\">&lt;/string</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"c\">&lt;!-- Caracteres especiales: apóstrofo \\&#x27; , comillas \\&quot; , salto de línea \\n --&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">&lt;string</span> <span class=\"a\">name</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;cita&quot;</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>Dijo: \\<span class=\"s\">&quot;Kotlin mola\\&quot;</span>\\nY tenía razón<span class=\"k\">&lt;/string</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"c\">&lt;!-- Lista de textos --&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">&lt;string-array</span> <span class=\"a\">name</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;colores&quot;</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">&lt;item</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>Rojo<span class=\"k\">&lt;/item</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">&lt;item</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>Verde<span class=\"k\">&lt;/item</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">&lt;item</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>Azul<span class=\"k\">&lt;/item</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">&lt;/string-array</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">&lt;/resources</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"1\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">MainActivity.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">Ejemplo</span>(nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span>, mensajes: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>) {\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> context = <span class=\"t\">LocalContext</span>.current\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> colores: <span class=\"t\">Array</span>&lt;<span class=\"t\">String</span>&gt; = <span class=\"f\">stringArrayResource</span>(R.array.colores)\n\n    <span class=\"t\">Column</span> {\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"f\">stringResource</span>(R.string.titulo))\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"f\">stringResource</span>(R.string.bienvenida, nombre, mensajes))\n        colores.forEach { color -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(color) }\n\n        <span class=\"t\">Button</span>(onClick = {\n            <span class=\"c\">// Dentro de onClick NO se puede llamar a stringResource (no es Composable):</span>\n            <span class=\"c\">// usamos el contexto</span>\n            <span class=\"t\">Toast</span>.<span class=\"f\">makeText</span>(context, context.<span class=\"f\">getString</span>(R.string.bienvenida, nombre, mensajes), <span class=\"t\">Toast</span>.<span class=\"t\">LENGTH_SHORT</span>).<span class=\"f\">show</span>()\n        }) {\n            <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"f\">stringResource</span>(R.string.titulo))\n        }\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\"><code>stringResource()</code> y <code>stringArrayResource()</code> <strong>solo se pueden llamar dentro de un Composable</strong>. En una función normal (por ejemplo la lógica de un botón) pásale el <code>context</code> y usa <code>context.getString(...)</code>.</div></div>", "subs": [{"id": "formato-del-id", "titulo": "Formato del ID"}, {"id": "stringresource-y-painterresource", "titulo": "stringResource() y painterResource()"}, {"id": "buenas-pr-cticas-todos-los-textos-en-strings-xml", "titulo": "Buenas prácticas: todos los textos en strings.xml"}], "codes": 4, "tables": 1}]}, {"id": "tema5", "numero": 5, "titulo": "Diseño de interfaces de usuario", "resumen": "Jetpack Compose y funciones Composable, Material Design 3 (Color.kt, Type.kt, Theme.kt), modificadores y layouts Column, Row y Box.", "badge": "Jetpack Compose & M3", "tech": "compose", "icon": "compose", "secciones": [{"id": "tema5-s1", "titulo": "1. Jetpack Compose", "html": "<p><strong>Jetpack Compose</strong> es el kit moderno de Google para crear interfaces en apps Android nativas. En lugar de XML, la interfaz se define <strong>con código Kotlin</strong>.</p><p><strong>Características:</strong></p><ul><li>Enfoque <strong>declarativo</strong>.</li><li>Código más <strong>simple, limpio y conciso</strong>.</li><li>Mejora la productividad y facilita <strong>reutilizar</strong> partes de la interfaz.</li><li>Se integra con las herramientas y librerías nativas de Android.</li><li>Es eficiente gracias a la <strong>recomposición</strong>: solo se redibuja lo que cambia.</li></ul><h3 id=\"declarativo-vs-imperativo\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Declarativo vs imperativo</span></h3><ul><li><strong>Imperativo</strong> (XML clásico): creas el componente, lo buscas (<code>findViewById</code>) y le cambias el texto paso a paso.</li><li><strong>Declarativo</strong> (Compose): describes <strong>qué</strong> quieres ver. <code>Text(\"Hola\")</code> = \"la interfaz debe mostrar un texto que diga Hola\".</li></ul><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>XML (tradicional)</th><th>Jetpack Compose</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Lenguaje de la UI</td><td>XML + Kotlin/Java</td><td>Solo Kotlin</td></tr><tr><td>Paradigma</td><td>Imperativo</td><td>Declarativo</td></tr><tr><td>Actualizar la UI</td><td>Manualmente (<code>findViewById</code>, <code>setText</code>…)</td><td>Automático al cambiar el estado</td></tr><tr><td>Reutilización</td><td>Layouts <code>include</code>, vistas custom</td><td>Funciones Composable</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"funciones-composable\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Funciones Composable</span></h3><ul><li>Bloque de código Kotlin que construye una parte de la interfaz. Se marca con <strong><code>@Composable</code></strong>.</li><li>Compose trae componentes ya hechos (cada uno es una función Composable): <code>Text</code>, <code>Button</code>, <code>Image</code>, <code>Box</code>, <code>Row</code>, <code>Column</code>…</li><li>Podemos crear <strong>las nuestras</strong> y llamarlas desde <code>setContent</code>.</li></ul><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">Saludo</span>(nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span>) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(text = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Hola, <span class=\"tp\">$nombre</span>&quot;</span>)\n}\n\n<span class=\"c\">// En la MainActivity:</span>\nsetContent {\n    <span class=\"t\">MiAppTheme</span> {\n        <span class=\"t\">Saludo</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Manuel&quot;</span>)\n    }\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">📌 <strong>Buena práctica:</strong> en los fragmentos cortos de los apuntes el texto se escribe directamente para que se lea mejor, pero en los <strong>ejercicios</strong> (y en tus prácticas) <strong>todos los textos van en <code>res/values/strings.xml</code></strong> y se usan con <code>stringResource()</code> o <code>context.getString()</code>. Lo tienes resumido en <em>Tema 4 › 4. Acceso a recursos</em>.</div></div><h3 id=\"c-mo-nombrar-las-funciones-composable\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Cómo nombrar las funciones Composable</span></h3><ol><li><strong>PascalCase</strong> (cada palabra con mayúscula, sin espacios ni guiones): <code>PantallaPrincipal</code>, <code>TarjetaDeProducto</code>, <code>BotonSuperior</code>.</li><li>Un <strong>sustantivo</strong> o \"adjetivo + sustantivo\", <strong>sin verbos</strong> (no <code>GetText</code>): construyen UI, no hacen acciones.</li><li><strong>Públicas</strong> en su fichero para poder reutilizarlas.</li></ol><h3 id=\"vista-previa-con-preview\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Vista previa con @Preview</span></h3><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@Preview</span>(showBackground = <span class=\"k\">true</span>)\n<span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">SaludoPreview</span>() {\n    <span class=\"t\">MiAppTheme</span> { <span class=\"t\">Saludo</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Manuel&quot;</span>) }\n}</code></pre></div>", "subs": [{"id": "declarativo-vs-imperativo", "titulo": "Declarativo vs imperativo"}, {"id": "funciones-composable", "titulo": "Funciones Composable"}, {"id": "c-mo-nombrar-las-funciones-composable", "titulo": "Cómo nombrar las funciones Composable"}, {"id": "vista-previa-con-preview", "titulo": "Vista previa con @Preview"}], "codes": 2, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema5-s2", "titulo": "2. Material Design y Material 3", "html": "<p><strong>Material Design</strong> es el sistema de diseño de Google (2014) con principios, guías y componentes para crear interfaces <strong>consistentes, intuitivas y atractivas</strong>. Ha evolucionado: Material Design 1, 2 y, actualmente, <strong>Material 3</strong>.</p><h3 id=\"principios-de-material-design\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Principios de Material Design</span></h3><ul><li><strong>Metáfora del material</strong>: inspirada en papel y tinta; sombras, profundidad y movimiento dan sensación física.</li><li><strong>Movimiento significativo</strong>: animaciones suaves que dan contexto sin distraer.</li><li><strong>Diseño adaptativo</strong>: se adapta a móviles, tablets…</li><li><strong>Énfasis en el contenido</strong>: jerarquía con color, tipografía y espaciado.</li></ul><h3 id=\"novedades-de-material-3-personalizaci-n\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Novedades de Material 3 (personalización)</span></h3><ul><li><strong>Paletas dinámicas</strong> (<em>dynamic color</em>): los colores se adaptan al fondo de pantalla del usuario.</li><li>Componentes <strong>rediseñados</strong> y más accesibles.</li><li><strong>Modo oscuro</strong> mejorado.</li><li>Enfoque en <strong>accesibilidad</strong> (contrastes, tamaños, espacios).</li><li><strong>Consistencia visual</strong> entre plataformas y <strong>flexibilidad</strong> para apps únicas.</li></ul><h3 id=\"la-api-materialtheme\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>La API MaterialTheme</span></h3><p>Define en un sitio central los <strong>colores</strong>, la <strong>tipografía</strong> y las <strong>formas</strong> de toda la app. Se configura con los ficheros del paquete <strong><code>ui.theme</code></strong>: <code>Color.kt</code>, <code>Type.kt</code> y <code>Theme.kt</code>.</p><div class=\"tabs\"><div class=\"tab-heads\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab active\" data-i=\"0\" title=\"app/src/main/java/com/example/miapp/ui/theme/Color.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>Color.kt</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"1\" title=\"app/src/main/java/com/example/miapp/ui/theme/Type.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>Type.kt</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"2\" title=\"app/src/main/java/com/example/miapp/ui/theme/Theme.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>Theme.kt</span></button></div><div class=\"tab-body active\" data-i=\"0\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">app/src/main/java/com/example/miapp/ui/theme/Color.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">package</span> com.example.miapp.ui.theme\n\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.graphics.<span class=\"t\">Color</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Colores generados por defecto</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> <span class=\"t\">Purple80</span> = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>(<span class=\"n\">0xFFD0BCFF</span>)\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> <span class=\"t\">PurpleGrey80</span> = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>(<span class=\"n\">0xFFCCC2DC</span>)\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> <span class=\"t\">Pink80</span> = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>(<span class=\"n\">0xFFEFB8C8</span>)\n\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> <span class=\"t\">Purple40</span> = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>(<span class=\"n\">0xFF6650a4</span>)\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> <span class=\"t\">PurpleGrey40</span> = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>(<span class=\"n\">0xFF625b71</span>)\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> <span class=\"t\">Pink40</span> = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>(<span class=\"n\">0xFF7D5260</span>)\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Colores propios (formato 0xAARRGGBB: FF = opaco)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> <span class=\"t\">DarkRed</span> = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>(<span class=\"n\">0xFF800000</span>)\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> <span class=\"t\">VerdeKotlin</span> = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>(<span class=\"n\">0xFF7F52FF</span>)</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"1\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">app/src/main/java/com/example/miapp/ui/theme/Type.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">package</span> com.example.miapp.ui.theme\n\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.material3.<span class=\"t\">Typography</span>\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.text.<span class=\"t\">TextStyle</span>\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.text.font.<span class=\"t\">FontFamily</span>\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.text.font.<span class=\"t\">FontWeight</span>\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.unit.sp\n\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> <span class=\"t\">Typography</span> = <span class=\"t\">Typography</span>(\n    bodyLarge = <span class=\"t\">TextStyle</span>(\n        fontFamily = <span class=\"t\">FontFamily</span>.<span class=\"t\">Default</span>,\n        fontWeight = <span class=\"t\">FontWeight</span>.<span class=\"t\">Normal</span>,\n        fontSize = <span class=\"n\">16</span>.sp,\n        lineHeight = <span class=\"n\">24</span>.sp,\n        letterSpacing = <span class=\"n\">0.5</span>.sp\n    ),\n    titleLarge = <span class=\"t\">TextStyle</span>(\n        fontFamily = <span class=\"t\">FontFamily</span>.<span class=\"t\">Serif</span>,\n        fontWeight = <span class=\"t\">FontWeight</span>.<span class=\"t\">Bold</span>,\n        fontSize = <span class=\"n\">24</span>.sp\n    )\n)</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"2\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">app/src/main/java/com/example/miapp/ui/theme/Theme.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">package</span> com.example.miapp.ui.theme\n\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> android.os.<span class=\"t\">Build</span>\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.foundation.isSystemInDarkTheme\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.material3.<span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.material3.darkColorScheme\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.material3.dynamicDarkColorScheme\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.material3.dynamicLightColorScheme\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.material3.lightColorScheme\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.runtime.<span class=\"t\">Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.ui.platform.<span class=\"t\">LocalContext</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">// 1) Esquemas ESTÁTICOS: colores definidos en Color.kt</span>\n<span class=\"k\">private</span> <span class=\"k\">val</span> <span class=\"t\">DarkColorScheme</span> = <span class=\"f\">darkColorScheme</span>(\n    primary = <span class=\"t\">Purple80</span>,\n    secondary = <span class=\"t\">PurpleGrey80</span>,\n    tertiary = <span class=\"t\">Pink80</span>\n)\n\n<span class=\"k\">private</span> <span class=\"k\">val</span> <span class=\"t\">LightColorScheme</span> = <span class=\"f\">lightColorScheme</span>(\n    primary = <span class=\"t\">Purple40</span>,\n    secondary = <span class=\"t\">PurpleGrey40</span>,\n    tertiary = <span class=\"t\">Pink40</span>\n)\n\n<span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">MiAppTheme</span>(\n    darkTheme: <span class=\"t\">Boolean</span> = <span class=\"f\">isSystemInDarkTheme</span>(),      <span class=\"c\">// modo claro/oscuro del sistema</span>\n    dynamicColor: <span class=\"t\">Boolean</span> = <span class=\"k\">true</span>,                    <span class=\"c\">// 2) DYNAMIC COLOR (Android 12+)</span>\n    content: <span class=\"a\">@Composable</span> () -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Unit</span>\n) {\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> colorScheme = <span class=\"k\">when</span> {\n        dynamicColor &amp;&amp; <span class=\"t\">Build</span>.<span class=\"t\">VERSION</span>.<span class=\"t\">SDK_INT</span> &gt;= <span class=\"t\">Build</span>.<span class=\"t\">VERSION_CODES</span>.S -&gt; {\n            <span class=\"k\">val</span> context = <span class=\"t\">LocalContext</span>.current\n            <span class=\"k\">if</span> (darkTheme) <span class=\"f\">dynamicDarkColorScheme</span>(context) <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"f\">dynamicLightColorScheme</span>(context)\n        }\n        darkTheme -&gt; <span class=\"t\">DarkColorScheme</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">else</span> -&gt; <span class=\"t\">LightColorScheme</span>\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>(\n        colorScheme = colorScheme,\n        typography = <span class=\"t\">Typography</span>,\n        content = content\n    )\n}</code></pre></div></div></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">Si pones <code>dynamicColor = false</code>, la app usará <strong>siempre tus colores</strong> de <code>LightColorScheme</code>/<code>DarkColorScheme</code> en lugar de los del fondo de pantalla.</div></div><h3 id=\"usar-el-tema-en-los-componentes\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Usar el tema en los componentes</span></h3><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">Text</span>(\n    text = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Título&quot;</span>,\n    color = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.primary,          <span class=\"c\">// colores del tema</span>\n    style = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.typography.titleLarge         <span class=\"c\">// tipografía del tema</span>\n)</code></pre></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Colores (<code>colorScheme</code>)</th><th>Tipografías (<code>typography</code>)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>primary</code>, <code>secondary</code>, <code>tertiary</code> (los más importantes)</td><td><code>displayLarge</code> / <code>displayMedium</code> / <code>displaySmall</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>onPrimary</code>, <code>onSecondary</code> (contenido encima)</td><td><code>headlineLarge</code> / <code>headlineMedium</code> / <code>headlineSmall</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>background</code>, <code>onBackground</code></td><td><code>titleLarge</code> / <code>titleMedium</code> / <code>titleSmall</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>surface</code>, <code>onSurface</code></td><td><code>bodyLarge</code> / <code>bodyMedium</code> / <code>bodySmall</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>error</code>, <code>onError</code></td><td><code>labelLarge</code> / <code>labelMedium</code> / <code>labelSmall</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>", "subs": [{"id": "principios-de-material-design", "titulo": "Principios de Material Design"}, {"id": "novedades-de-material-3-personalizaci-n", "titulo": "Novedades de Material 3 (personalización)"}, {"id": "la-api-materialtheme", "titulo": "La API MaterialTheme"}, {"id": "usar-el-tema-en-los-componentes", "titulo": "Usar el tema en los componentes"}], "codes": 4, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema5-s3", "titulo": "3. Modificadores", "html": "<p>Un <strong>Modifier</strong> permite <strong>personalizar y transformar</strong> un Composable: apariencia, comportamiento o posición. Se <strong>encadenan</strong> con <code>.</code></p><p><strong>Características:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Inmutables</strong>: cada modificador crea un objeto nuevo.</li><li><strong>Encadenables</strong>: cada uno devuelve un Modifier con todo lo anterior.</li><li><strong>El orden importa</strong>: se aplican de arriba a abajo.</li><li><strong>Reutilizables</strong>: puedes guardar un Modifier en una variable y usarlo en varios sitios.</li></ul><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">Text</span>(\n    text = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Hola&quot;</span>,\n    modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>\n        .<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(<span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp)            <span class=\"c\">// margen exterior</span>\n        .<span class=\"f\">background</span>(<span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Yellow</span>)  <span class=\"c\">// fondo</span>\n        .<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(<span class=\"n\">8</span>.dp)             <span class=\"c\">// relleno interior (va después del fondo)</span>\n        .<span class=\"f\">border</span>(<span class=\"n\">2</span>.dp, <span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Red</span>)\n)\n\n<span class=\"c\">// ¡El orden cambia el resultado!</span>\n<span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">background</span>(<span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Yellow</span>).<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(<span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp)   <span class=\"c\">// el amarillo incluye el padding</span>\n<span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(<span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp).<span class=\"f\">background</span>(<span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Yellow</span>)   <span class=\"c\">// el padding queda fuera del amarillo</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Modifier reutilizable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> estiloCaja = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">size</span>(<span class=\"n\">100</span>.dp).<span class=\"f\">border</span>(<span class=\"n\">1</span>.dp, <span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Black</span>)</code></pre></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Modificador</th><th>Qué hace</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>.padding()</code></td><td>Espacio alrededor del contenido</td></tr><tr><td><code>.width()</code> / <code>.height()</code></td><td>Ancho / alto</td></tr><tr><td><code>.size()</code></td><td>Ancho y alto</td></tr><tr><td><code>.fillMaxWidth()</code> / <code>.fillMaxHeight()</code> / <code>.fillMaxSize()</code></td><td>Ocupa todo el ancho / alto / espacio disponible</td></tr><tr><td><code>.border()</code></td><td>Borde (grosor, color, forma)</td></tr><tr><td><code>.background()</code></td><td>Color de fondo</td></tr><tr><td><code>.weight()</code></td><td>Reparte el espacio dentro de <code>Row</code> o <code>Column</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>.clickable { }</code></td><td>Hace el componente pulsable</td></tr></tbody></table></div>", "subs": [], "codes": 1, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema5-s4", "titulo": "4. Layouts", "html": "<p>Un <strong>layout</strong> organiza otros elementos en la interfaz. En Compose usaremos sobre todo <strong>Column</strong>, <strong>Row</strong> y <strong>Box</strong>, y los combinaremos.</p><h3 id=\"column-vertical\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Column (vertical)</span></h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Valores</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>modifier</code></td><td>tamaño, padding, background…</td></tr><tr><td><code>horizontalAlignment</code></td><td><code>Alignment.Start</code>, <code>Alignment.CenterHorizontally</code>, <code>Alignment.End</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>verticalArrangement</code></td><td><code>Arrangement.Top</code>, <code>Center</code>, <code>Bottom</code>, <code>SpaceBetween</code>, <code>SpaceEvenly</code>, <code>SpaceAround</code>, <code>spacedBy(8.dp)</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>content</code></td><td>los hijos, entre llaves</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">Column</span>(\n    modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">fillMaxSize</span>().<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(<span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp),\n    horizontalAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">CenterHorizontally</span>,\n    verticalArrangement = <span class=\"t\">Arrangement</span>.<span class=\"f\">spacedBy</span>(<span class=\"n\">12</span>.dp)\n) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Uno&quot;</span>)\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Dos&quot;</span>)\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Tres&quot;</span>)\n}</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"row-horizontal\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Row (horizontal)</span></h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Valores</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>horizontalArrangement</code></td><td><code>Arrangement.Start</code>, <code>Center</code>, <code>End</code>, <code>SpaceEvenly</code>, <code>SpaceAround</code>, <code>SpaceBetween</code>, <code>spacedBy(…)</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>verticalAlignment</code></td><td><code>Alignment.Top</code>, <code>Alignment.CenterVertically</code>, <code>Alignment.Bottom</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">Row</span>(\n    modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">fillMaxWidth</span>().<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(<span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp),\n    horizontalArrangement = <span class=\"t\">Arrangement</span>.<span class=\"t\">SpaceEvenly</span>,\n    verticalAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">CenterVertically</span>\n) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Izquierda&quot;</span>)\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Centro&quot;</span>)\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Derecha&quot;</span>)\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">Truco: en <code>Column</code> el <strong>eje principal</strong> es vertical → se \"reparte\" con <code>verticalArrangement</code> y se \"alinea\" en horizontal. En <code>Row</code> es al revés.</div></div><h3 id=\"box-apilar\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Box (apilar)</span></h3><ul><li>Apila elementos <strong>uno encima de otro</strong>, en el orden en que se declaran (el último queda arriba). Ideal para <strong>texto sobre imagen</strong>.</li><li><code>contentAlignment</code>: <code>Alignment.TopStart</code>, <code>TopCenter</code>, <code>TopEnd</code>, <code>CenterStart</code>, <code>Center</code>, <code>CenterEnd</code>, <code>BottomStart</code>, <code>BottomCenter</code>, <code>BottomEnd</code>.</li><li>Cada hijo puede colocarse por separado con <strong><code>Modifier.align(...)</code></strong>.</li></ul><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">Box</span>(\n    modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">size</span>(<span class=\"n\">200</span>.dp).<span class=\"f\">background</span>(<span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">LightGray</span>),\n    contentAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">Center</span>\n) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Centro&quot;</span>)\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Arriba izq.&quot;</span>, modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">align</span>(<span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">TopStart</span>))\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Abajo dcha.&quot;</span>, modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">align</span>(<span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">BottomEnd</span>))\n}</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"repartir-espacio-con-weight\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Repartir espacio con weight</span></h3><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">Column</span>(modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">fillMaxSize</span>()) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Box</span>(modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">fillMaxWidth</span>().<span class=\"f\">weight</span>(<span class=\"n\">1f</span>).<span class=\"f\">background</span>(<span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Red</span>))   <span class=\"c\">// 1/3</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Box</span>(modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">fillMaxWidth</span>().<span class=\"f\">weight</span>(<span class=\"n\">2f</span>).<span class=\"f\">background</span>(<span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Blue</span>))  <span class=\"c\">// 2/3</span>\n}</code></pre></div>", "subs": [{"id": "column-vertical", "titulo": "Column (vertical)"}, {"id": "row-horizontal", "titulo": "Row (horizontal)"}, {"id": "box-apilar", "titulo": "Box (apilar)"}, {"id": "repartir-espacio-con-weight", "titulo": "Repartir espacio con weight"}], "codes": 4, "tables": 2}]}, {"id": "tema6", "numero": 6, "titulo": "Componentes básicos", "resumen": "Text, Image, Icon, Spacer, HorizontalDivider, Button, Toast, Card, reutilización, estados (remember), TextField, RadioButton, Checkbox y Switch.", "badge": "UI Components & State", "tech": "compose", "icon": "kotlin", "secciones": [{"id": "tema6-s1", "titulo": "1. Text", "html": "<p><code>Text</code> muestra texto en pantalla: títulos, subtítulos, párrafos, etiquetas…</p><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">📌 <strong>Buena práctica:</strong> en los fragmentos cortos de los apuntes el texto se escribe directamente para que se lea mejor, pero en los <strong>ejercicios</strong> (y en tus prácticas) <strong>todos los textos van en <code>res/values/strings.xml</code></strong> y se usan con <code>stringResource()</code> o <code>context.getString()</code>. Lo tienes resumido en <em>Tema 4 › 4. Acceso a recursos</em>.</div></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Para qué</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>text</code></td><td>Contenido</td></tr><tr><td><code>modifier</code></td><td>Tamaño, fondo, posición…</td></tr><tr><td><code>color</code></td><td>Color del texto</td></tr><tr><td><code>fontSize</code></td><td>Tamaño (<code>20.sp</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>fontWeight</code></td><td>Grosor: <code>FontWeight.Bold</code>, <code>Normal</code>, <code>Light</code>…</td></tr><tr><td><code>fontStyle</code></td><td><code>FontStyle.Normal</code> o <code>FontStyle.Italic</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>textAlign</code></td><td><code>TextAlign.Center</code>, <code>TextAlign.Start</code>…</td></tr><tr><td><code>maxLines</code></td><td>Nº máximo de líneas</td></tr><tr><td><code>style</code></td><td>Un <code>TextStyle</code> (p. ej. <code>MaterialTheme.typography.titleLarge</code>)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">Text</span>(\n    text = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Kotlin mola&quot;</span>,\n    modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">fillMaxWidth</span>().<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(<span class=\"n\">8</span>.dp),\n    color = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>(<span class=\"n\">0xFF7F52FF</span>),\n    fontSize = <span class=\"n\">22</span>.sp,\n    fontWeight = <span class=\"t\">FontWeight</span>.<span class=\"t\">Bold</span>,\n    fontStyle = <span class=\"t\">FontStyle</span>.<span class=\"t\">Italic</span>,\n    textAlign = <span class=\"t\">TextAlign</span>.<span class=\"t\">Center</span>,\n    maxLines = <span class=\"n\">1</span>,\n    overflow = <span class=\"t\">TextOverflow</span>.<span class=\"t\">Ellipsis</span>      <span class=\"c\">// pone &quot;…&quot; si no cabe</span>\n)</code></pre></div>", "subs": [], "codes": 1, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema6-s2", "titulo": "2. Image e Icon", "html": "<h3 id=\"image\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Image</span></h3><p>Muestra imágenes locales (<code>res/drawable</code>: <code>.png</code>, <code>.jpg</code>, vectores <code>.xml</code>) o remotas.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Para qué</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>painter</code></td><td>La imagen (<code>painterResource(R.drawable.foto)</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>contentDescription</code></td><td>Descripción para accesibilidad</td></tr><tr><td><code>modifier</code></td><td>Tamaño, posición, forma (<code>.clip(CircleShape)</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>contentScale</code></td><td><code>ContentScale.Fit</code>, <code>Crop</code>, <code>Inside</code>…</td></tr><tr><td><code>alignment</code></td><td><code>Alignment.Center</code>, <code>TopStart</code>…</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"icon\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Icon</span></h3><p>Muestra un <strong>icono vectorial</strong> (navegación, favoritos, buscar, ajustes, borrar…).</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Para qué</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>imageVector</code></td><td>Vector del icono (<code>Icons.Filled.Favorite</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>painter</code></td><td>Alternativa: un recurso gráfico</td></tr><tr><td><code>contentDescription</code></td><td>Accesibilidad</td></tr><tr><td><code>modifier</code></td><td>Tamaño (<code>.size(32.dp)</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>tint</code></td><td>Color</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">Image</span>(\n    painter = <span class=\"f\">painterResource</span>(id = R.drawable.perfil),\n    contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Foto de perfil&quot;</span>,\n    modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">size</span>(<span class=\"n\">120</span>.dp).<span class=\"f\">clip</span>(<span class=\"t\">CircleShape</span>),\n    contentScale = <span class=\"t\">ContentScale</span>.<span class=\"t\">Crop</span>\n)\n\n<span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(\n    imageVector = <span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">Favorite</span>,\n    contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Favorito&quot;</span>,\n    tint = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Red</span>,\n    modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">size</span>(<span class=\"n\">32</span>.dp)\n)</code></pre></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">Los iconos básicos (<code>Favorite</code>, <code>Home</code>, <code>Info</code>, <code>Settings</code>, <code>Star</code>, <code>Call</code>, <code>Delete</code>, <code>Search</code>…) vienen incluidos. Para iconos extra (<code>DirectionsCar</code>, <code>SportsSoccer</code>…) añade en <code>app/build.gradle.kts</code> la dependencia <code>implementation(\"androidx.compose.material:material-icons-extended\")</code>.</div></div>", "subs": [{"id": "image", "titulo": "Image"}, {"id": "icon", "titulo": "Icon"}], "codes": 1, "tables": 2}, {"id": "tema6-s3", "titulo": "3. Spacer y HorizontalDivider", "html": "<ul><li><strong>Spacer</strong>: espacio <strong>vacío</strong> entre componentes (en <code>Row</code>, <code>Column</code> o <code>Box</code>) usando <code>height</code>, <code>width</code>, <code>weight</code>, <code>fillMaxSize</code>. No muestra nada; solo separa.</li><li><strong>HorizontalDivider</strong>: dibuja una <strong>línea horizontal</strong> para separar secciones. Parámetros: <code>modifier</code>, <code>thickness</code>, <code>color</code>.</li></ul><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">Column</span> {\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Arriba&quot;</span>)\n    <span class=\"t\">Spacer</span>(modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">height</span>(<span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp))\n    <span class=\"t\">HorizontalDivider</span>(thickness = <span class=\"n\">2</span>.dp, color = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Gray</span>)\n    <span class=\"t\">Spacer</span>(modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">height</span>(<span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp))\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Abajo&quot;</span>)\n}</code></pre></div>", "subs": [], "codes": 1, "tables": 0}, {"id": "tema6-s4", "titulo": "4. Button", "html": "<p>Elemento interactivo que ejecuta una acción al pulsarlo. Variantes de Material 3:</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Variante</th><th>Aspecto</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>Button</code></td><td>Estándar, con fondo relleno</td></tr><tr><td><code>OutlinedButton</code></td><td>Solo contorno</td></tr><tr><td><code>TextButton</code></td><td>Solo texto</td></tr><tr><td><code>IconButton</code></td><td>Solo un icono</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Para qué</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>onClick</code></td><td>Lambda <code>() -&gt; Unit</code> que se ejecuta al pulsar</td></tr><tr><td><code>modifier</code></td><td>Tamaño, posición</td></tr><tr><td><code>enabled</code></td><td><code>true</code> por defecto; con <code>false</code> aparece inactivo</td></tr><tr><td><code>colors</code></td><td><code>ButtonDefaults.buttonColors()</code>, <code>ButtonDefaults.outlinedButtonColors()</code>, <code>IconButtonDefaults.iconButtonColors()</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>contentPadding</code></td><td>Espaciado interior</td></tr><tr><td><code>shape</code></td><td><code>RoundedCornerShape(8.dp)</code>, <code>CircleShape</code>…</td></tr><tr><td><code>content</code></td><td>Lo que va dentro (un <code>Text</code>, un <code>Icon</code>…)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"toast\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Toast</span></h3><p>Mensaje que aparece unos segundos y desaparece solo, sin recibir el foco. Se crea con <code>Toast.makeText(contexto, texto, duración).show()</code>:</p><ul><li><strong>Contexto</strong>: <code>LocalContext.current</code> (se obtiene dentro de un Composable).</li><li><strong>Texto</strong>: un String o el ID de <code>strings.xml</code>.</li><li><strong>Duración</strong>: <code>Toast.LENGTH_SHORT</code> o <code>Toast.LENGTH_LONG</code>.</li></ul><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">Botones</span>() {\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> context = <span class=\"t\">LocalContext</span>.current\n    <span class=\"t\">Column</span>(verticalArrangement = <span class=\"t\">Arrangement</span>.<span class=\"f\">spacedBy</span>(<span class=\"n\">8</span>.dp)) {\n        <span class=\"t\">Button</span>(\n            <span class=\"c\">// El texto viene de strings.xml: &lt;string name=&quot;mensaje_toast&quot;&gt;Este es el mensaje del Toast&lt;/string&gt;</span>\n            onClick = { <span class=\"t\">Toast</span>.<span class=\"f\">makeText</span>(context, R.string.mensaje_toast, <span class=\"t\">Toast</span>.<span class=\"t\">LENGTH_SHORT</span>).<span class=\"f\">show</span>() },\n            colors = <span class=\"t\">ButtonDefaults</span>.<span class=\"f\">buttonColors</span>(containerColor = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>(<span class=\"n\">0xFF7F52FF</span>), contentColor = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">White</span>),\n            shape = <span class=\"t\">RoundedCornerShape</span>(<span class=\"n\">8</span>.dp)\n        ) {\n            <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Button&quot;</span>)\n        }\n        <span class=\"t\">OutlinedButton</span>(onClick = { }) { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;OutlinedButton&quot;</span>) }\n        <span class=\"t\">TextButton</span>(onClick = { }) { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;TextButton&quot;</span>) }\n        <span class=\"t\">IconButton</span>(onClick = { }) {\n            <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">Favorite</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Me gusta&quot;</span>, tint = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Red</span>)\n        }\n        <span class=\"t\">Button</span>(onClick = { }, enabled = <span class=\"k\">false</span>) { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Deshabilitado&quot;</span>) }\n    }\n}</code></pre></div>", "subs": [{"id": "toast", "titulo": "Toast"}], "codes": 1, "tables": 2}, {"id": "tema6-s5", "titulo": "5. Card y ElevatedCard", "html": "<ul><li><strong>Card</strong>: contenedor que <strong>agrupa información relacionada</strong> con sombra y elevación. Puede contener texto, imágenes y otros Composables.</li><li><strong>ElevatedCard</strong>: variante con <strong>más elevación</strong>, para destacarla del fondo.</li></ul><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Card</th><th>ElevatedCard</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>colors</code></td><td><code>CardDefaults.cardColors()</code></td><td><code>CardDefaults.elevatedCardColors()</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>elevation</code></td><td><code>CardDefaults.cardElevation()</code></td><td><code>CardDefaults.elevatedCardElevation()</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>shape</code></td><td>forma</td><td>forma</td></tr><tr><td><code>border</code></td><td><code>BorderStroke(1.dp, Color.Gray)</code></td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td><code>modifier</code>, <code>content</code></td><td>sí</td><td>sí</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">Card</span>(\n    modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">fillMaxWidth</span>().<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(<span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp),\n    shape = <span class=\"t\">RoundedCornerShape</span>(<span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp),\n    colors = <span class=\"t\">CardDefaults</span>.<span class=\"f\">cardColors</span>(containerColor = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>(<span class=\"n\">0xFFEDE7FF</span>)),\n    elevation = <span class=\"t\">CardDefaults</span>.<span class=\"f\">cardElevation</span>(defaultElevation = <span class=\"n\">6</span>.dp),\n    border = <span class=\"t\">BorderStroke</span>(<span class=\"n\">1</span>.dp, <span class=\"t\">Color</span>(<span class=\"n\">0xFF7F52FF</span>))\n) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Column</span>(modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(<span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp)) {\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Título de la tarjeta&quot;</span>, style = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.typography.titleLarge)\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Contenido de la tarjeta&quot;</span>)\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"t\">ElevatedCard</span>(\n    elevation = <span class=\"t\">CardDefaults</span>.<span class=\"f\">elevatedCardElevation</span>(defaultElevation = <span class=\"n\">12</span>.dp)\n) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Tarjeta elevada&quot;</span>, modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(<span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp))\n}</code></pre></div>", "subs": [], "codes": 1, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema6-s6", "titulo": "6. Reutilización de componentes", "html": "<p>Podemos crear <strong>componentes reutilizables</strong>: funciones Composable que representan un elemento concreto y que usamos tantas veces como queramos, pasando por <strong>parámetro</strong> lo que cambia.</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">TextoAzul</span>(\n    mensaje: <span class=\"t\">String</span>,                 <span class=\"c\">// obligatorio (sin valor por defecto)</span>\n    tamano: <span class=\"t\">TextUnit</span> = <span class=\"n\">20</span>.sp,        <span class=\"c\">// opcional (tiene valor por defecto)</span>\n    color: <span class=\"t\">Color</span> = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Blue</span>\n) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(text = mensaje, fontSize = tamano, color = color)\n}\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Uso</span>\n<span class=\"t\">TextoAzul</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Hola&quot;</span>)                                  <span class=\"c\">// usa 20.sp y azul</span>\n<span class=\"t\">TextoAzul</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Grande&quot;</span>, tamano = <span class=\"n\">32</span>.sp)                <span class=\"c\">// cambia solo el tamaño</span>\n<span class=\"t\">TextoAzul</span>(mensaje = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Rojo&quot;</span>, color = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Red</span>)     <span class=\"c\">// argumentos con nombre</span></code></pre></div><ul><li>Si un parámetro <strong>tiene valor por defecto</strong>, solo lo pasas si quieres cambiarlo.</li><li>Si <strong>no lo tiene</strong> (como <code>mensaje</code>), es obligatorio.</li><li>Estos componentes pueden ir en <strong>otros ficheros Kotlin</strong> (p. ej. <code>Componentes.kt</code>) para separarlos de la pantalla principal.</li></ul><div class=\"tree\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#F88909\" d=\"M10 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-8l-2-2z\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Estructura del proyecto Android</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">PROYECTO</span></div></div><pre>app/src/main/java/com/example/miapp/\n├── MainActivity.kt\n└── ui/\n    ├── components/Componentes.kt   ← TextoAzul, BotonRedondo…\n    └── theme/…</pre></div>", "subs": [], "codes": 1, "tables": 0}, {"id": "tema6-s7", "titulo": "7. Estados en Jetpack Compose", "html": "<p>Un <strong>estado</strong> es cualquier valor que <strong>puede cambiar</strong> y que influye en lo que se ve. Cuando cambia, Compose <strong>recompone solo las partes</strong> que lo leen.</p><ul><li><strong>Estado local</strong>: dentro de un Composable, con <code>remember</code> o <code>rememberSaveable</code>.</li><li><strong>Estado externo</strong>: en un <code>ViewModel</code> con <code>MutableState</code> o <code>StateFlow</code> (más adelante).</li></ul><h3 id=\"remember-mutablestateof\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>remember + mutableStateOf</span></h3><p><code>remember</code> <strong>conserva</strong> el valor entre recomposiciones (si no, se reiniciaría cada vez que se redibuja). Lo combinamos con un <strong>estado observable</strong>:</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Función</th><th>Tipo</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>mutableIntStateOf</code></td><td><code>Int</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>mutableLongStateOf</code></td><td><code>Long</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>mutableFloatStateOf</code></td><td><code>Float</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>mutableDoubleStateOf</code></td><td><code>Double</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>mutableStateOf</code></td><td><code>String</code>, <code>Boolean</code>, objetos, data classes, colecciones</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.runtime.getValue\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.runtime.setValue\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.runtime.mutableIntStateOf\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> androidx.compose.runtime.remember\n\n<span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">Contador</span>() {\n    <span class=\"k\">var</span> count <span class=\"k\">by</span> remember { <span class=\"f\">mutableIntStateOf</span>(<span class=\"n\">0</span>) }   <span class=\"c\">// &quot;by&quot; delega get/set en remember</span>\n\n    <span class=\"t\">Column</span>(horizontalAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">CenterHorizontally</span>) {\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Has pulsado <span class=\"tp\">$count</span> veces&quot;</span>)              <span class=\"c\">// solo este Text se recompone</span>\n        <span class=\"t\">Button</span>(onClick = { count++ }) {\n            <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Incrementar&quot;</span>)\n        }\n    }\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\"><code>by</code> es una palabra clave de Kotlin que <strong>delega</strong> el get/set de la variable. Necesita los imports <code>getValue</code> y <code>setValue</code>.</div></div><h3 id=\"remembersaveable\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>rememberSaveable</span></h3><p><code>remember</code> pierde el valor si la Activity se <strong>destruye y recrea</strong> (p. ej. al <strong>girar la pantalla</strong>). <code>rememberSaveable</code> lo guarda en un <strong>Bundle</strong> y lo recupera:</p><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">var</span> count <span class=\"k\">by</span> rememberSaveable { <span class=\"f\">mutableIntStateOf</span>(<span class=\"n\">0</span>) }</code></pre></div><ul><li>El Bundle guarda pares clave-valor (<code>Int</code>, <code>Long</code>, <code>Float</code>, <code>Double</code>, <code>Boolean</code>, <code>Byte</code>, <code>Char</code>, <code>Short</code>, <code>String</code>…).</li><li><strong>No es una base de datos</strong>: úsalo solo para lo que interesa recuperar (datos de un formulario, selección de un Checkbox o Switch…).</li></ul>", "subs": [{"id": "remember-mutablestateof", "titulo": "remember + mutableStateOf"}, {"id": "remembersaveable", "titulo": "rememberSaveable"}], "codes": 2, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema6-s8", "titulo": "8. TextField", "html": "<p>Permite al usuario <strong>escribir y modificar texto</strong> (formularios, buscadores, comentarios…). Es un componente <strong>controlado con estado</strong>: lo que muestra viene de <code>value</code> y los cambios llegan por <code>onValueChange</code> (lambda <code>(String) -&gt; Unit</code>).</p><ul><li><code>TextField</code>: relleno con línea inferior.</li><li><code>OutlinedTextField</code>: fondo transparente y borde completo.</li></ul><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Para qué</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>value</code> / <code>onValueChange</code></td><td>Texto actual / lambda con el nuevo texto</td></tr><tr><td><code>label</code></td><td>Etiqueta</td></tr><tr><td><code>placeholder</code></td><td>Texto de ayuda cuando está vacío</td></tr><tr><td><code>leadingIcon</code> / <code>trailingIcon</code></td><td>Icono al inicio / al final</td></tr><tr><td><code>isError</code></td><td>Lo marca como erróneo (borde rojo)</td></tr><tr><td><code>enabled</code> / <code>readOnly</code></td><td>Deshabilitado / no editable pero no deshabilitado</td></tr><tr><td><code>singleLine</code></td><td>Una sola línea</td></tr><tr><td><code>visualTransformation</code></td><td><code>PasswordVisualTransformation()</code> para contraseñas</td></tr><tr><td><code>keyboardOptions</code></td><td>Tipo de teclado: <code>KeyboardOptions(keyboardType = KeyboardType.Number)</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>colors</code></td><td><code>TextFieldDefaults.colors()</code> / <code>OutlinedTextFieldDefaults.colors()</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">var</span> nombre <span class=\"k\">by</span> rememberSaveable { <span class=\"f\">mutableStateOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;&quot;</span>) }\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> password <span class=\"k\">by</span> rememberSaveable { <span class=\"f\">mutableStateOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;&quot;</span>) }\n\n<span class=\"t\">TextField</span>(\n    <span class=\"k\">value</span> = nombre,\n    onValueChange = { nombre = <span class=\"k\">it</span> },\n    label = { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Nombre&quot;</span>) },\n    placeholder = { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Escribe tu nombre&quot;</span>) },\n    leadingIcon = { <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">Person</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"k\">null</span>) },\n    singleLine = <span class=\"k\">true</span>\n)\n\n<span class=\"t\">OutlinedTextField</span>(\n    <span class=\"k\">value</span> = password,\n    onValueChange = { password = <span class=\"k\">it</span> },\n    label = { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Contraseña&quot;</span>) },\n    visualTransformation = <span class=\"t\">PasswordVisualTransformation</span>(),\n    isError = password.<span class=\"f\">isNotEmpty</span>() &amp;&amp; password.length &lt; <span class=\"n\">4</span>,\n    trailingIcon = { <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">Lock</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"k\">null</span>) },\n    singleLine = <span class=\"k\">true</span>\n)</code></pre></div>", "subs": [], "codes": 1, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema6-s9", "titulo": "9. RadioButton", "html": "<p>Permite elegir <strong>una sola opción</strong> de un grupo excluyente. <strong>No incluye texto</strong>: se combina con <code>Row</code> + <code>Text</code>. La opción elegida se guarda en un <strong>estado</strong>.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Para qué</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>selected</code></td><td>Si está seleccionado</td></tr><tr><td><code>onClick</code></td><td>Lambda al pulsar</td></tr><tr><td><code>enabled</code>, <code>modifier</code></td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td><code>colors</code></td><td><code>RadioButtonDefaults.colors(selectedColor = …)</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">val</span> opciones = <span class=\"f\">listOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Kotlin&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Java&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Python&quot;</span>)\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> seleccion <span class=\"k\">by</span> rememberSaveable { <span class=\"f\">mutableStateOf</span>(opciones[<span class=\"n\">0</span>]) }\n\n<span class=\"t\">Column</span> {\n    opciones.forEach { opcion -&gt;\n        <span class=\"t\">Row</span>(\n            verticalAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">CenterVertically</span>,\n            modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">fillMaxWidth</span>().clickable { seleccion = opcion }   <span class=\"c\">// toda la fila pulsable</span>\n        ) {\n            <span class=\"t\">RadioButton</span>(selected = seleccion == opcion, onClick = { seleccion = opcion })\n            <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(opcion)\n        }\n    }\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Has elegido: <span class=\"tp\">$seleccion</span>&quot;</span>)\n}</code></pre></div>", "subs": [], "codes": 1, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema6-s10", "titulo": "10. Checkbox", "html": "<p>Permite <strong>marcar varias opciones</strong> a la vez, de forma independiente (aceptar condiciones, preferencias, listas…). Cada Checkbox necesita <strong>su propio estado</strong>.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Para qué</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>checked</code></td><td>Marcado (<code>true</code>) o no (<code>false</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>onCheckedChange</code></td><td>Lambda <code>(Boolean) -&gt; Unit</code> cuando cambia</td></tr><tr><td><code>enabled</code>, <code>modifier</code></td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td><code>colors</code></td><td><code>CheckboxDefaults.colors(checkedColor = …)</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">var</span> aceptaCondiciones <span class=\"k\">by</span> rememberSaveable { <span class=\"f\">mutableStateOf</span>(<span class=\"k\">false</span>) }\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> recibirNoticias <span class=\"k\">by</span> rememberSaveable { <span class=\"f\">mutableStateOf</span>(<span class=\"k\">true</span>) }\n\n<span class=\"t\">Row</span>(verticalAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">CenterVertically</span>) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Checkbox</span>(checked = aceptaCondiciones, onCheckedChange = { aceptaCondiciones = <span class=\"k\">it</span> })\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Acepto las condiciones&quot;</span>)\n}\n<span class=\"t\">Row</span>(verticalAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">CenterVertically</span>) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Checkbox</span>(checked = recibirNoticias, onCheckedChange = { recibirNoticias = <span class=\"k\">it</span> })\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Quiero recibir noticias&quot;</span>)\n}\n<span class=\"t\">Button</span>(onClick = { }, enabled = aceptaCondiciones) { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Continuar&quot;</span>) }</code></pre></div>", "subs": [], "codes": 1, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema6-s11", "titulo": "11. Switch", "html": "<p>Interruptor <strong>encendido/apagado</strong> (valor binario), controlado con estado. Ideal para configuraciones rápidas.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Para qué</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>checked</code></td><td>Activado o no</td></tr><tr><td><code>onCheckedChange</code></td><td>Lambda <code>(Boolean) -&gt; Unit</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>enabled</code>, <code>modifier</code></td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td><code>thumbContent</code></td><td>Contenido del círculo que se mueve (opcional, p. ej. un icono)</td></tr><tr><td><code>colors</code></td><td><code>SwitchDefaults.colors(checkedThumbColor = …, checkedTrackColor = …)</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">var</span> modoOscuro <span class=\"k\">by</span> rememberSaveable { <span class=\"f\">mutableStateOf</span>(<span class=\"k\">false</span>) }\n\n<span class=\"t\">Row</span>(verticalAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">CenterVertically</span>) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Modo oscuro&quot;</span>, modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">weight</span>(<span class=\"n\">1f</span>))\n    <span class=\"t\">Switch</span>(\n        checked = modoOscuro,\n        onCheckedChange = { modoOscuro = <span class=\"k\">it</span> },\n        thumbContent = <span class=\"k\">if</span> (modoOscuro) {\n            { <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">Check</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"k\">null</span>, modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">size</span>(<span class=\"t\">SwitchDefaults</span>.<span class=\"t\">IconSize</span>)) }\n        } <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"k\">null</span>\n    )\n}</code></pre></div>", "subs": [], "codes": 1, "tables": 1}]}, {"id": "tema7", "numero": 7, "titulo": "Componentes avanzados", "resumen": "Listas con LazyColumn y LazyRow, DropdownMenu, listas con estado (mutableStateListOf), Scaffold (TopAppBar, FAB, BottomAppBar) y State Hoisting.", "badge": "Lazy Lists & Scaffold", "tech": "android", "icon": "android", "secciones": [{"id": "tema7-s1", "titulo": "1. Listas: LazyColumn y LazyRow", "html": "<div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">📌 <strong>Buena práctica:</strong> en los fragmentos cortos de los apuntes el texto se escribe directamente para que se lea mejor, pero en los <strong>ejercicios</strong> (y en tus prácticas) <strong>todos los textos van en <code>res/values/strings.xml</code></strong> y se usan con <code>stringResource()</code> o <code>context.getString()</code>. Lo tienes resumido en <em>Tema 4 › 4. Acceso a recursos</em>.</div></div><p>Las listas muestran <strong>muchos elementos ordenados</strong> (productos, películas, contactos…). Compose tiene dos componentes:</p><ul><li><strong>LazyColumn</strong>: lista <strong>vertical</strong> con scroll.</li><li><strong>LazyRow</strong>: lista <strong>horizontal</strong> con scroll.</li></ul><p><strong>Lazy</strong> = \"perezoso\": solo crea los elementos <strong>visibles</strong> en pantalla y los va cargando <strong>bajo demanda</strong> al hacer scroll → menos memoria y mejor rendimiento con muchos datos.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>LazyColumn</th><th>LazyRow</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>modifier</code></td><td>tamaño, fondo, márgenes</td><td>igual</td></tr><tr><td><code>contentPadding</code></td><td>espacio alrededor de todo el contenido</td><td>igual</td></tr><tr><td>Alineación</td><td><code>horizontalAlignment</code> (<code>Start</code>, <code>CenterHorizontally</code>, <code>End</code>)</td><td><code>verticalAlignment</code> (<code>Top</code>, <code>CenterVertically</code>, <code>Bottom</code>)</td></tr><tr><td>Separación</td><td><code>verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)</code></td><td><code>horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"items-e-item\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>items e item</span></h3><ul><li><strong><code>items(lista) { elemento -&gt; … }</code></strong>: recorre una lista y genera un componente por cada elemento.</li><li><strong><code>item { … }</code></strong>: añade <strong>un único</strong> elemento en una posición (un título, un espacio…).</li></ul><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">val</span> frutas = <span class=\"f\">listOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Manzana&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Pera&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Plátano&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Naranja&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Kiwi&quot;</span>)\n\n<span class=\"t\">LazyColumn</span>(\n    modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">fillMaxSize</span>(),\n    contentPadding = <span class=\"t\">PaddingValues</span>(<span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp),\n    verticalArrangement = <span class=\"t\">Arrangement</span>.<span class=\"f\">spacedBy</span>(<span class=\"n\">8</span>.dp)\n) {\n    item {\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Mis frutas&quot;</span>, style = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.typography.headlineMedium)\n    }\n    <span class=\"f\">items</span>(frutas) { fruta -&gt;\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(fruta, style = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.typography.bodyLarge)\n    }\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">val</span> colores = <span class=\"f\">listOf</span>(<span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Red</span>, <span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Green</span>, <span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Blue</span>, <span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Yellow</span>, <span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">Magenta</span>)\n\n<span class=\"t\">LazyRow</span>(\n    contentPadding = <span class=\"t\">PaddingValues</span>(horizontal = <span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp),\n    horizontalArrangement = <span class=\"t\">Arrangement</span>.<span class=\"f\">spacedBy</span>(<span class=\"n\">12</span>.dp),\n    verticalAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">CenterVertically</span>\n) {\n    <span class=\"f\">items</span>(colores) { color -&gt;\n        <span class=\"t\">Box</span>(modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">size</span>(<span class=\"n\">100</span>.dp).<span class=\"f\">background</span>(color))\n    }\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">Importa <code>androidx.compose.foundation.lazy.items</code> para poder pasar la lista a <code>items(...)</code>. Si necesitas la posición usa <code>itemsIndexed(lista) { index, elemento -&gt; }</code>.</div></div>", "subs": [{"id": "items-e-item", "titulo": "items e item"}], "codes": 2, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema7-s2", "titulo": "2. DropdownMenu", "html": "<p>Menú <strong>desplegable</strong> que aparece al pulsar un botón o icono. No se muestra solo: depende de un <strong>estado</strong> (abierto/cerrado) controlado desde fuera. Útil para elegir una opción sin ocupar espacio fijo.</p><ul><li><strong>DropdownMenu</strong>: contenedor de las opciones.</li><li><strong>DropdownMenuItem</strong>: cada opción.</li></ul><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>DropdownMenu</th><th>DropdownMenuItem</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>expanded</code>: si está abierto</td><td><code>text</code>: contenido (un <code>Text</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>onDismissRequest</code>: al pedir cerrarlo (clic fuera)</td><td><code>onClick</code>: al elegir la opción</td></tr><tr><td><code>modifier</code></td><td><code>leadingIcon</code> / <code>trailingIcon</code> (opcionales)</td></tr><tr><td><code>offset</code>: desplazar su posición</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">var</span> expandido <span class=\"k\">by</span> remember { <span class=\"f\">mutableStateOf</span>(<span class=\"k\">false</span>) }\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> opcion <span class=\"k\">by</span> remember { <span class=\"f\">mutableStateOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Ninguna&quot;</span>) }\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> opciones = <span class=\"f\">listOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Rojo&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Verde&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Azul&quot;</span>)\n\n<span class=\"t\">Box</span> {                                            <span class=\"c\">// el Box sirve de &quot;ancla&quot; del menú</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Button</span>(onClick = { expandido = <span class=\"k\">true</span> }) {\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Elegir color&quot;</span>)\n    }\n    <span class=\"t\">DropdownMenu</span>(\n        expanded = expandido,\n        onDismissRequest = { expandido = <span class=\"k\">false</span> }\n    ) {\n        opciones.forEach { color -&gt;\n            <span class=\"t\">DropdownMenuItem</span>(\n                text = { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(color) },\n                onClick = {\n                    opcion = color\n                    expandido = <span class=\"k\">false</span>            <span class=\"c\">// cerramos al elegir</span>\n                }\n            )\n        }\n    }\n}\n<span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Seleccionado: <span class=\"tp\">$opcion</span>&quot;</span>)</code></pre></div>", "subs": [], "codes": 1, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema7-s3", "titulo": "3. Estados con listas: mutableStateListOf", "html": "<p>Para una lista que <strong>cambia durante la ejecución</strong> usamos <strong><code>mutableStateListOf</code></strong>: una lista <strong>observable</strong> que avisa a Compose al <strong>añadir, eliminar o modificar</strong> elementos, y la UI se actualiza sola.</p><ul><li>Se declara con <strong><code>remember</code></strong> (<strong>nunca</strong> con <code>rememberSaveable</code>).</li><li>Funciona con <code>LazyColumn</code> y <code>LazyRow</code>.</li></ul><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Operación</th><th>Qué hace</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>add(elemento)</code></td><td>Añade al final</td></tr><tr><td><code>add(posición, elemento)</code></td><td>Inserta en la posición</td></tr><tr><td><code>remove(elemento)</code></td><td>Elimina la primera ocurrencia</td></tr><tr><td><code>removeAt(posición)</code></td><td>Elimina la de esa posición</td></tr><tr><td><code>set(posición, elemento)</code></td><td>Reemplaza</td></tr><tr><td><code>clear()</code></td><td>Vacía la lista</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">val</span> tareas = remember { <span class=\"f\">mutableStateListOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Estudiar Kotlin&quot;</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Hacer la compra&quot;</span>) }\n<span class=\"k\">var</span> nueva <span class=\"k\">by</span> remember { <span class=\"f\">mutableStateOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;&quot;</span>) }\n\n<span class=\"t\">Column</span> {\n    <span class=\"t\">Row</span> {\n        <span class=\"t\">OutlinedTextField</span>(<span class=\"k\">value</span> = nueva, onValueChange = { nueva = <span class=\"k\">it</span> }, modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">weight</span>(<span class=\"n\">1f</span>))\n        <span class=\"t\">Button</span>(onClick = { <span class=\"k\">if</span> (nueva.<span class=\"f\">isNotBlank</span>()) { tareas.<span class=\"f\">add</span>(nueva); nueva = <span class=\"s\">&quot;&quot;</span> } }) { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Añadir&quot;</span>) }\n    }\n    <span class=\"t\">LazyColumn</span> {\n        <span class=\"f\">items</span>(tareas) { tarea -&gt;\n            <span class=\"t\">Row</span>(verticalAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">CenterVertically</span>) {\n                <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(tarea, modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">weight</span>(<span class=\"n\">1f</span>))\n                <span class=\"t\">IconButton</span>(onClick = { tareas.<span class=\"f\">remove</span>(tarea) }) {\n                    <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">Delete</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Borrar&quot;</span>)\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}</code></pre></div>", "subs": [], "codes": 1, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema7-s4", "titulo": "4. Scaffold", "html": "<p><strong>Scaffold</strong> (\"andamio\") es un contenedor que da la <strong>estructura básica</strong> de una pantalla y coloca cada zona en su sitio automáticamente:</p><ul><li><strong>TopAppBar</strong>: barra superior de acciones.</li><li><strong>BottomAppBar</strong>: barra inferior de acciones.</li><li><strong>NavigationBar</strong>: barra inferior de navegación.</li><li><strong>FloatingActionButton</strong>: botón flotante.</li><li><strong>Snackbar</strong>: notificaciones temporales.</li><li><strong>NavigationDrawer</strong>: menú lateral (no va dentro del Scaffold, sino que <strong>lo envuelve</strong>).</li></ul><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Para qué</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>topBar</code></td><td>Barra superior</td></tr><tr><td><code>bottomBar</code></td><td>Barra inferior</td></tr><tr><td><code>floatingActionButton</code></td><td>Botón flotante</td></tr><tr><td><code>snackbarHost</code></td><td>Contenedor del Snackbar</td></tr><tr><td><code>containerColor</code> / <code>contentColor</code></td><td>Colores</td></tr><tr><td><code>content</code></td><td><strong>Obligatorio</strong>. Recibe <code>paddingValues</code>: el espacio a respetar para que el contenido no quede tapado por las barras</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@OptIn</span>(<span class=\"t\">ExperimentalMaterial3Api</span>::<span class=\"k\">class</span>)\n<span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">Pantalla</span>() {\n    <span class=\"t\">Scaffold</span>(\n        topBar = { <span class=\"t\">TopAppBar</span>(title = { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Mi app&quot;</span>) }) },\n        bottomBar = { <span class=\"t\">BottomAppBar</span> { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Barra inferior&quot;</span>, modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(<span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp)) } },\n        floatingActionButton = {\n            <span class=\"t\">FloatingActionButton</span>(onClick = { }) { <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">Add</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Añadir&quot;</span>) }\n        }\n    ) { paddingValues -&gt;\n        <span class=\"t\">Column</span>(modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(paddingValues).<span class=\"f\">fillMaxSize</span>()) {   <span class=\"c\">// ¡aplicar el padding!</span>\n            <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Contenido principal&quot;</span>)\n        }\n    }\n}</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"topappbar\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>TopAppBar</span></h3><p>Barra superior con el <strong>título</strong> y acciones (buscar, ajustes, volver…). Requiere <code>@OptIn(ExperimentalMaterial3Api::class)</code>.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Para qué</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>title</code></td><td>Título (normalmente un <code>Text</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>navigationIcon</code></td><td>Icono de la izquierda (menú, atrás)</td></tr><tr><td><code>actions</code></td><td>Iconos/botones de la derecha</td></tr><tr><td><code>colors</code></td><td><code>TopAppBarDefaults.topAppBarColors(containerColor = …, titleContentColor = …)</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">TopAppBar</span>(\n    title = { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Ajustes&quot;</span>) },\n    navigationIcon = {\n        <span class=\"t\">IconButton</span>(onClick = { }) { <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">AutoMirrored</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">ArrowBack</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Atrás&quot;</span>) }\n    },\n    actions = {\n        <span class=\"t\">IconButton</span>(onClick = { }) { <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">Search</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Buscar&quot;</span>) }\n        <span class=\"t\">IconButton</span>(onClick = { }) { <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">MoreVert</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Más&quot;</span>) }\n    },\n    colors = <span class=\"t\">TopAppBarDefaults</span>.<span class=\"f\">topAppBarColors</span>(\n        containerColor = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.primary,\n        titleContentColor = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.onPrimary,\n        navigationIconContentColor = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.onPrimary,\n        actionIconContentColor = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.onPrimary\n    )\n)</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"floatingactionbutton\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>FloatingActionButton</span></h3><p>Botón circular que <strong>flota</strong> sobre el contenido (normalmente abajo a la derecha) para la <strong>acción principal</strong> de la pantalla.</p><ul><li>Variantes: <code>FloatingActionButton</code>, <code>SmallFloatingActionButton</code>, <code>LargeFloatingActionButton</code>, <code>ExtendedFloatingActionButton</code> (icono + texto).</li><li>Parámetros: <code>onClick</code>, <code>modifier</code>, <code>containerColor</code>, <code>contentColor</code>, <code>shape</code> (<code>CircleShape</code>), <code>elevation</code> (<code>FloatingActionButtonDefaults.elevation()</code>), <code>content</code>.</li></ul><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">FloatingActionButton</span>(\n    onClick = { },\n    containerColor = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.tertiary,\n    contentColor = <span class=\"t\">Color</span>.<span class=\"t\">White</span>,\n    shape = <span class=\"t\">CircleShape</span>,\n    elevation = <span class=\"t\">FloatingActionButtonDefaults</span>.<span class=\"f\">elevation</span>(defaultElevation = <span class=\"n\">8</span>.dp)\n) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">Add</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Añadir&quot;</span>)\n}\n\n<span class=\"t\">ExtendedFloatingActionButton</span>(\n    onClick = { },\n    icon = { <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">Edit</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"k\">null</span>) },\n    text = { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Escribir&quot;</span>) }\n)</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"bottomappbar\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>BottomAppBar</span></h3><p>Barra <strong>inferior</strong> de acciones (buscar, compartir, editar…).</p><ul><li>Parámetros: <code>modifier</code>, <code>containerColor</code>, <code>contentColor</code>, <code>actions</code> (iconos a la izquierda), <code>content</code> (usa <code>Row</code> para distribuirlos a tu gusto).</li></ul><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"t\">BottomAppBar</span>(\n    containerColor = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.primaryContainer,\n    actions = {\n        <span class=\"t\">IconButton</span>(onClick = { }) { <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">Home</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Inicio&quot;</span>) }\n        <span class=\"t\">IconButton</span>(onClick = { }) { <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">Share</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Compartir&quot;</span>) }\n        <span class=\"t\">IconButton</span>(onClick = { }) { <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(<span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">Edit</span>, contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Editar&quot;</span>) }\n    }\n)</code></pre></div>", "subs": [{"id": "topappbar", "titulo": "TopAppBar"}, {"id": "floatingactionbutton", "titulo": "FloatingActionButton"}, {"id": "bottomappbar", "titulo": "BottomAppBar"}], "codes": 4, "tables": 2}, {"id": "tema7-s5", "titulo": "5. State Hoisting", "html": "<p><strong>State Hoisting</strong> (\"elevación del estado\") es un patrón que consiste en <strong>subir el estado</strong> de un componente al Composable que lo contiene (el \"padre\"). Así el padre controla el valor y puede compartirlo; el componente hijo queda <strong>reutilizable</strong> y <strong>sin estado</strong> (<em>stateless</em>).</p><p>Un Composable con State Hoisting:</p><ol><li><strong>No guarda el estado</strong> internamente: lo <strong>recibe por parámetro</strong>.</li><li>Expone un <strong>callback</strong> (una función por parámetro) para <strong>avisar al padre</strong> de que quiere cambiarlo.</li></ol><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"c\">// Componente de nivel inferior (&quot;Hijo&quot;): sin estado, reutilizable</span>\n<span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">CampoNombre</span>(nombre: <span class=\"t\">String</span>, onNombreChange: (<span class=\"t\">String</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Unit</span>) {\n    <span class=\"t\">OutlinedTextField</span>(\n        <span class=\"k\">value</span> = nombre,                     <span class=\"c\">// recibe el estado</span>\n        onValueChange = onNombreChange,     <span class=\"c\">// avisa del cambio</span>\n        label = { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Nombre&quot;</span>) }\n    )\n}\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Componente de nivel superior (&quot;Padre&quot;): dueño del estado</span>\n<span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">PantallaSaludo</span>() {\n    <span class=\"k\">var</span> nombre <span class=\"k\">by</span> rememberSaveable { <span class=\"f\">mutableStateOf</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;&quot;</span>) }\n    <span class=\"t\">Column</span> {\n        <span class=\"t\">CampoNombre</span>(nombre = nombre, onNombreChange = { nombre = <span class=\"k\">it</span> })\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Hola, <span class=\"tp\">$nombre</span>&quot;</span>)               <span class=\"c\">// el padre puede compartir el estado</span>\n    }\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"code logcat\" data-lang=\"text\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-log\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3DDC84\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3DDC84\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M7 9l3 3-3 3M12 15h5\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Consola / Diagrama</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">ESQUEMA</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code>       estado (valor) ↓\n┌───────── Padre ─────────┐\n│  var nombre by …        │\n└─────────────────────────┘\n       ↑ evento (callback)\n┌───────── Hijo ──────────┐\n│  CampoNombre(nombre,    │\n│    onNombreChange)      │\n└─────────────────────────┘</code></pre></div>", "subs": [], "codes": 2, "tables": 0}]}, {"id": "tema8", "numero": 8, "titulo": "Navegación e Intents", "resumen": "Navigation Compose (NavController, NavHost, rutas tipadas con @Serializable), navegación con TopAppBar y NavigationBar, Intents implícitos y permisos en tiempo de ejecución.", "badge": "Navigation & Intents", "tech": "compose", "icon": "compose", "secciones": [{"id": "tema8-s1", "titulo": "1. Navigation Compose", "html": "<p>La navegación permite desplazarnos entre las diferentes pantallas de una aplicación. En Jetpack Compose es común utilizar una única <code>Activity</code> (<em>Single-Activity Architecture</em>), por lo que la navegación entre pantallas se realiza dentro de esta actividad:</p><ul><li>Cuando nos desplazamos a una pantalla, esta se añade a la <strong>pila de navegación</strong> (<em>back stack</em>).</li><li>Si volvemos atrás, la pantalla actual se retira de la pila y se muestra la anterior.</li></ul><p><strong>Navigation Compose</strong> es la forma moderna de manejar la navegación cuando trabajamos con Jetpack Compose.</p><h3 id=\"componentes-y-m-todos-de-navigation-compose\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Componentes y métodos de Navigation Compose</span></h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Componente / Método</th><th>Descripción y función</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>NavController</code></td><td>Controla la navegación entre las diferentes pantallas.</td></tr><tr><td><code>NavHost</code></td><td>Contenedor donde se muestran las pantallas de la aplicación. Recibe <code>navController</code>, <code>startDestination</code> (primera pantalla que se mostrará en la app) y opcionalmente <code>modifier</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>composable&lt;Ruta&gt;</code></td><td>Define y registra cada pantalla como una ruta de navegación.</td></tr><tr><td><code>rememberNavController()</code></td><td>Crea el <code>NavController</code> y lo recupera para usarlo en futuras recomposiciones de la UI, evitando que la app pierda el historial de navegación cada vez que se redibuja la pantalla.</td></tr><tr><td><code>navController.navigate()</code></td><td>Permite navegar hacia otra pantalla recibiendo un objeto de la ruta a la que queremos acceder.</td></tr><tr><td><code>navController.popBackStack()</code></td><td>Permite volver a la pantalla anterior, retirando la pantalla actual de la pila de navegación.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"configuraci-n-previa-dependencias-y-kotlin-serialization\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Configuración previa (Dependencias y Kotlin Serialization)</span></h3><p>Para utilizar Navigation Compose con seguridad de tipos (<strong>Type-safe Navigation</strong>), debemos añadir las dependencias necesarias y configurar el plugin de Kotlin Serialization en el proyecto, y finalmente pulsar <strong>Sync Now</strong> para sincronizar:</p><div class=\"tabs\"><div class=\"tab-heads\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab active\" data-i=\"0\" title=\"gradle/libs.versions.toml\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>libs.versions.toml</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"1\" title=\"app/build.gradle.kts\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>build.gradle.kts</span></button></div><div class=\"tab-body active\" data-i=\"0\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"toml\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">gradle/libs.versions.toml</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">GRADLE TOML</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code>[versions]\n# <span class=\"t\">Navigation</span> <span class=\"t\">Compose</span> y <span class=\"t\">Serialización</span>\nnavigationCompose = <span class=\"s\">&quot;2.8.8&quot;</span> # <span class=\"t\">Versión</span> estable de <span class=\"t\">Navigation</span> <span class=\"t\">Compose</span> que introduce <span class=\"t\">Type</span>-safe navigation\nkotlinxSerialization = <span class=\"s\">&quot;1.7.3&quot;</span> # <span class=\"t\">Herramientas</span> de serialización que utiliza <span class=\"t\">Navigation</span> <span class=\"t\">Compose</span>\n\n[libraries]\n# <span class=\"t\">Navigation</span> <span class=\"t\">Compose</span> y <span class=\"t\">Serialización</span>\nandroidx-navigation-compose = { group = <span class=\"s\">&quot;androidx.navigation&quot;</span>, name = <span class=\"s\">&quot;navigation-compose&quot;</span>, version.ref = <span class=\"s\">&quot;navigationCompose&quot;</span> }\nkotlinx-serialization-json = { group = <span class=\"s\">&quot;org.jetbrains.kotlinx&quot;</span>, name = <span class=\"s\">&quot;kotlinx-serialization-json&quot;</span>, version.ref = <span class=\"s\">&quot;kotlinxSerialization&quot;</span> }\n\n[plugins]\n# <span class=\"t\">Plugin</span> para la <span class=\"t\">Serialización</span> de objetos <span class=\"t\">Kotlin</span>\nkotlin-serialization = { id = <span class=\"s\">&quot;org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.serialization&quot;</span>, version.ref = <span class=\"s\">&quot;kotlin&quot;</span> }</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"1\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kts\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">app/build.gradle.kts</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">GRADLE KTS</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code>plugins {\n    <span class=\"c\">// Plugin para Serialización de objetos Kotlin</span>\n    <span class=\"f\">alias</span>(libs.plugins.kotlin.serialization)\n}\n\ndependencies {\n    <span class=\"c\">// Navigation Compose y Serialización</span>\n    <span class=\"f\">implementation</span>(libs.androidx.navigation.compose)\n    <span class=\"f\">implementation</span>(libs.kotlinx.serialization.json)\n}</code></pre></div></div></div><h3 id=\"type-safe-navigation-rutas-navgraph-y-paso-de-par-metros\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Type-safe Navigation: rutas, NavGraph y paso de parámetros</span></h3><p>En Navigation Compose, <strong>Type-safe Navigation</strong> permite definir las rutas hacia las pantallas mediante clases u objetos serializables de Kotlin en lugar de cadenas de texto, reduciendo los errores durante la navegación:</p><ul><li><code>@Serializable</code>: indica que una clase u objeto puede serializarse.</li><li><code>object</code>: para pantallas que <strong>no necesitan recibir parámetros</strong> (por ejemplo, <code>HomeRoute</code>).</li><li><code>data class</code>: para pantallas que <strong>necesitan recibir parámetros</strong> (por ejemplo, <code>DetailRoute</code>).</li></ul><div class=\"tree\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#F88909\" d=\"M10 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-8l-2-2z\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Estructura del proyecto Android</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">PROYECTO</span></div></div><pre>ui/\n├── navigation/\n│   ├── Routes.kt          (objetos y data classes @Serializable)\n│   └── NavGraph.kt        (NavHost con los destinos composable&lt;Ruta&gt;)\n├── screens/\n│   ├── HomeScreen.kt      (pantalla de inicio desacoplada del NavController)\n│   └── DetailScreen.kt    (pantalla de detalle que recibe argumentos)\n└── MainActivity.kt        (crea rememberNavController() e invoca NavGraph)</pre></div><ul><li><strong>Desacoplamiento de pantallas</strong>: <code>HomeScreen</code> recibe la función lambda <code>onNavigateToDetail: (Int, String) -&gt; Unit</code>. No conoce directamente el <code>NavController</code>; simplemente comunica su intención de navegar invocando la lambda, y es el <code>NavGraph</code> el encargado de ejecutar <code>navController.navigate(...)</code>.</li><li><strong>Recuperación de argumentos en destino</strong>: en <code>composable&lt;DetailRoute&gt; { backStackEntry -&gt; ... }</code>, <code>backStackEntry</code> representa la entrada de la pantalla en la pila de navegación y <code>toRoute&lt;DetailRoute&gt;()</code> recupera el objeto de la ruta para pasar sus propiedades a <code>DetailScreen</code>.</li></ul><div class=\"tabs\"><div class=\"tab-heads\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab active\" data-i=\"0\" title=\"ui/navigation/Routes.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>Routes.kt</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"1\" title=\"ui/navigation/NavGraph.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>NavGraph.kt</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"2\" title=\"ui/screens/HomeScreen.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>HomeScreen.kt</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"3\" title=\"ui/screens/DetailScreen.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>DetailScreen.kt</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"4\" title=\"MainActivity.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>MainActivity.kt</span></button></div><div class=\"tab-body active\" data-i=\"0\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">ui/navigation/Routes.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">package</span> com.example.cursojetpackcompose.ui.navigation\n\n<span class=\"k\">import</span> kotlinx.serialization.<span class=\"t\">Serializable</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Representa la pantalla Home, que no recibe parámetros</span>\n<span class=\"a\">@Serializable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">object</span> <span class=\"t\">HomeRoute</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Representa la pantalla Detail, que recibe id y nombre del producto</span>\n<span class=\"a\">@Serializable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">data</span> <span class=\"k\">class</span> <span class=\"t\">DetailRoute</span>(\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> productId: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>,\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> productName: <span class=\"t\">String</span>\n)</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"1\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">ui/navigation/NavGraph.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">NavGraph</span>(navController: <span class=\"t\">NavHostController</span>) {\n    <span class=\"c\">// Grafo de navegación que controla qué pantalla mostrar</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">NavHost</span>(\n        navController = navController,\n        startDestination = <span class=\"t\">HomeRoute</span> <span class=\"c\">// Pantalla que se cargará de inicio en la app</span>\n    ) {\n        <span class=\"c\">// Comportamiento de la pantalla &quot;Home&quot;</span>\n        composable&lt;<span class=\"t\">HomeRoute</span>&gt; {\n            <span class=\"t\">HomeScreen</span>(\n                onNavigateToDetail = { id, name -&gt;\n                    navController.<span class=\"f\">navigate</span>(\n                        route = <span class=\"t\">DetailRoute</span>(\n                            productId = id,\n                            productName = name\n                        )\n                    )\n                }\n            )\n        }\n\n        <span class=\"c\">// Comportamiento de la pantalla &quot;Detail&quot;</span>\n        composable&lt;<span class=\"t\">DetailRoute</span>&gt; { backStackEntry -&gt;\n            <span class=\"k\">val</span> args = backStackEntry.toRoute&lt;<span class=\"t\">DetailRoute</span>&gt;()\n            <span class=\"t\">DetailScreen</span>(\n                productId = args.productId,\n                productName = args.productName\n            )\n        }\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"2\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">ui/screens/HomeScreen.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">HomeScreen</span>(\n    onNavigateToDetail: (<span class=\"t\">Int</span>, <span class=\"t\">String</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"t\">Unit</span>\n) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Column</span>(\n        modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>\n            .<span class=\"f\">fillMaxSize</span>()\n            .<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(all = <span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp),\n        verticalArrangement = <span class=\"t\">Arrangement</span>.<span class=\"t\">Center</span>,\n        horizontalAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">CenterHorizontally</span>\n    ) {\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(\n            text = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Tienda de Productos&quot;</span>,\n            style = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.typography.headlineMedium,\n            color = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.primary\n        )\n\n        <span class=\"t\">Spacer</span>(modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">height</span>(<span class=\"n\">32</span>.dp))\n\n        <span class=\"c\">// Producto seleccionable</span>\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(\n            text = <span class=\"s\">&quot;PC Gaming (ID = 1)&quot;</span>,\n            style = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.typography.headlineSmall,\n            modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>\n                .<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(top = <span class=\"n\">24</span>.dp)\n                .clickable {\n                    <span class=\"f\">onNavigateToDetail</span>(<span class=\"n\">1</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;PC Gaming&quot;</span>)\n                }\n        )\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"3\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">ui/screens/DetailScreen.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">DetailScreen</span>(\n    productId: <span class=\"t\">Int</span>,\n    productName: <span class=\"t\">String</span>\n) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Column</span>(\n        modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>\n            .<span class=\"f\">fillMaxSize</span>()\n            .<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(all = <span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp),\n        verticalArrangement = <span class=\"t\">Arrangement</span>.<span class=\"t\">Center</span>,\n        horizontalAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">CenterHorizontally</span>\n    ) {\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(\n            text = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Detalle del Producto&quot;</span>,\n            style = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.typography.headlineMedium,\n            color = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.primary\n        )\n\n        <span class=\"t\">Spacer</span>(modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">height</span>(<span class=\"n\">24</span>.dp))\n\n        <span class=\"c\">// Mostramos los datos recibidos por parámetros procedentes de la pantalla &quot;HomeScreen&quot;</span>\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(\n            text = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Nombre: <span class=\"tp\">$productName</span>&quot;</span>,\n            style = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.typography.headlineSmall\n        )\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(\n            text = <span class=\"s\">&quot;ID del Producto: <span class=\"tp\">$productId</span>&quot;</span>,\n            style = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.typography.headlineSmall\n        )\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"4\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">MainActivity.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"k\">package</span> com.example.cursojetpackcompose\n\n<span class=\"k\">class</span> <span class=\"t\">MainActivity</span> : <span class=\"t\">ComponentActivity</span>() {\n    <span class=\"k\">override</span> <span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"f\">onCreate</span>(savedInstanceState: <span class=\"t\">Bundle</span>?) {\n        <span class=\"k\">super</span>.<span class=\"f\">onCreate</span>(savedInstanceState)\n        <span class=\"f\">enableEdgeToEdge</span>()\n        setContent {\n            <span class=\"t\">EjemploNavigationComposeTheme</span> {\n                <span class=\"t\">NavigationComposeExample</span>()\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">NavigationComposeExample</span>() {\n    <span class=\"c\">// Creamos el control de navegación</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> navController = <span class=\"f\">rememberNavController</span>()\n    <span class=\"c\">// Invocamos a la función que contiene el grafo de navegación pasándole el control de navegación</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">NavGraph</span>(navController = navController)\n}</code></pre></div></div></div>", "subs": [{"id": "componentes-y-m-todos-de-navigation-compose", "titulo": "Componentes y métodos de Navigation Compose"}, {"id": "configuraci-n-previa-dependencias-y-kotlin-serialization", "titulo": "Configuración previa (Dependencias y Kotlin Serialization)"}, {"id": "type-safe-navigation-rutas-navgraph-y-paso-de-par-metros", "titulo": "Type-safe Navigation: rutas, NavGraph y paso de parámetros"}], "codes": 7, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema8-s2", "titulo": "2. Navegación con TopAppBar", "html": "<p>También podemos utilizar una <strong>barra superior</strong> (<code>TopAppBar</code>) para facilitar la navegación entre pantallas (por ejemplo, añadiendo a la tienda de productos un icono para volver atrás y otro para acceder al detalle del producto).</p><ul><li>Para integrar la <code>TopAppBar</code> y el <code>NavGraph</code> utilizamos un componente <strong><code>Scaffold</code></strong>: la barra superior se coloca en el parámetro <code>topBar</code> y el grafo de navegación en el contenido respetando <code>Modifier.padding(paddingValues)</code>.</li><li>La navegación se ejecuta directamente desde el propio <code>Scaffold</code> utilizando <code>navController.navigate()</code> y <code>navController.popBackStack()</code>, ya que el Composable que contiene el <code>Scaffold</code> actúa como coordinador y tiene visibilidad directa del <code>NavController</code>.</li></ul><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">Por tanto, cuando navegamos desde la <code>TopAppBar</code> del <code>Scaffold</code>, <strong>no es necesario notificar la intención de navegación al <code>NavGraph</code> mediante funciones lambdas</strong> desde <code>HomeScreen</code>.</div></div><div class=\"tabs\"><div class=\"tab-heads\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab active\" data-i=\"0\" title=\"MainActivity.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>MainActivity.kt</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"1\" title=\"ui/navigation/NavGraph.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>NavGraph.kt</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"2\" title=\"ui/screens/HomeScreen.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>HomeScreen.kt</span></button></div><div class=\"tab-body active\" data-i=\"0\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">MainActivity.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">NavigationComposeExample</span>() {\n    <span class=\"c\">// Creamos el control de navegación</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> navController = <span class=\"f\">rememberNavController</span>()\n\n    <span class=\"c\">// Scaffold que contiene la TopAppBar y el NavGraph</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Scaffold</span>(\n        topBar = {\n            <span class=\"t\">TopAppBar</span>(\n                title = {\n                    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Navigation Compose&quot;</span>)\n                },\n                navigationIcon = {\n                    <span class=\"t\">IconButton</span>( <span class=\"c\">// Icono de volver atrás</span>\n                        onClick = {\n                            navController.<span class=\"f\">popBackStack</span>()\n                        }\n                    ) {\n                        <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(\n                            imageVector = <span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">AutoMirrored</span>.<span class=\"t\">Filled</span>.<span class=\"t\">ArrowBack</span>,\n                            contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Volver&quot;</span>\n                        )\n                    }\n                },\n                actions = {\n                    <span class=\"t\">IconButton</span>( <span class=\"c\">// Producto seleccionable</span>\n                        onClick = {\n                            navController.<span class=\"f\">navigate</span>(\n                                route = <span class=\"t\">DetailRoute</span>(\n                                    productId = <span class=\"n\">1</span>,\n                                    productName = <span class=\"s\">&quot;PC Gaming&quot;</span>\n                                )\n                            )\n                        }\n                    ) {\n                        <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(\n                            imageVector = <span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Default</span>.<span class=\"t\">Info</span>,\n                            contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Producto&quot;</span>\n                        )\n                    }\n                }\n            )\n        }\n    ) { paddingValues -&gt;\n        <span class=\"c\">// Contenido del Scaffold</span>\n        <span class=\"t\">NavGraph</span>(\n            navController = navController,\n            modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(paddingValues)\n        )\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"1\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">ui/navigation/NavGraph.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">NavGraph</span>(\n    navController: <span class=\"t\">NavHostController</span>,\n    modifier: <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span> = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>\n) {\n    <span class=\"c\">// Grafo de navegación que controla qué pantalla mostrar</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">NavHost</span>(\n        navController = navController,\n        startDestination = <span class=\"t\">HomeRoute</span>, <span class=\"c\">// Pantalla que se cargará de inicio en la app</span>\n        modifier = modifier\n    ) {\n        <span class=\"c\">// Comportamiento de la pantalla &quot;Home&quot; (no necesita lambda de navegación)</span>\n        composable&lt;<span class=\"t\">HomeRoute</span>&gt; {\n            <span class=\"t\">HomeScreen</span>()\n        }\n\n        <span class=\"c\">// Comportamiento de la pantalla &quot;Detail&quot;</span>\n        composable&lt;<span class=\"t\">DetailRoute</span>&gt; { backStackEntry -&gt;\n            <span class=\"k\">val</span> args = backStackEntry.toRoute&lt;<span class=\"t\">DetailRoute</span>&gt;()\n            <span class=\"t\">DetailScreen</span>(\n                productId = args.productId,\n                productName = args.productName\n            )\n        }\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"2\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">ui/screens/HomeScreen.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"c\">// HomeScreen sin parámetros ni .clickable (DetailScreen se mantiene igual)</span>\n<span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">HomeScreen</span>() {\n    <span class=\"t\">Column</span>(\n        modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>\n            .<span class=\"f\">fillMaxSize</span>()\n            .<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(all = <span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp),\n        verticalArrangement = <span class=\"t\">Arrangement</span>.<span class=\"t\">Center</span>,\n        horizontalAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">CenterHorizontally</span>\n    ) {\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(\n            text = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Tienda de Productos&quot;</span>,\n            style = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.typography.headlineMedium,\n            color = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.primary\n        )\n\n        <span class=\"t\">Spacer</span>(modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">height</span>(<span class=\"n\">32</span>.dp))\n\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(\n            text = <span class=\"s\">&quot;PC Gaming (ID = 1)&quot;</span>,\n            style = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.typography.headlineSmall,\n            modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(top = <span class=\"n\">24</span>.dp)\n        )\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div></div>", "subs": [], "codes": 3, "tables": 0}, {"id": "tema8-s3", "titulo": "3. Navegación con NavigationBar", "html": "<p><strong><code>NavigationBar</code></strong> permite mostrar una barra de navegación en la parte inferior de la pantalla, resultando especialmente útil cuando una aplicación dispone de varias secciones principales (por ejemplo: <code>Home</code>, <code>Favourites</code> y <code>Settings</code>).</p><ul><li>Se integra mediante el parámetro <strong><code>bottomBar</code></strong> de <code>Scaffold</code>.</li><li>Puede personalizarse con <code>containerColor</code> (color del contenedor) y <code>contentColor</code> (color del contenido interno).</li><li>Al igual que con la barra superior, el <code>Scaffold</code> conoce el <code>NavController</code>, por lo que cada ítem ejecuta <code>navController.navigate(...)</code> directamente sin necesidad de lambdas.</li></ul><h3 id=\"par-metros-de-navigationbaritem\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Parámetros de NavigationBarItem</span></h3><p>Cada sección de la barra inferior se representa mediante un <strong><code>NavigationBarItem</code></strong>:</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parámetro</th><th>Descripción</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>selected</code></td><td>Indica si el ítem está seleccionado (<code>Boolean</code>). Se comprueba obteniendo el destino actual con <code>navController.currentBackStackEntryAsState()</code> y evaluando <code>destination?.hasRoute&lt;Ruta&gt;() == true</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>onClick</code></td><td>Función lambda <code>() -&gt; Unit</code> que se ejecuta al pulsar el ítem (normalmente <code>navController.navigate(Ruta)</code>).</td></tr><tr><td><code>icon</code></td><td>Composable con el icono que representa la opción.</td></tr><tr><td><code>label</code></td><td>Composable con el texto descriptivo de la opción.</td></tr><tr><td><code>colors</code></td><td>Permite configurar los colores de fondo, iconos y texto del ítem mediante <code>NavigationBarItemDefaults.colors()</code>.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tabs\"><div class=\"tab-heads\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab active\" data-i=\"0\" title=\"MainActivity.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>MainActivity.kt</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"1\" title=\"ui/navigation/NavGraph.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>NavGraph.kt</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"2\" title=\"ui/screens/HomeScreen.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>HomeScreen.kt</span></button></div><div class=\"tab-body active\" data-i=\"0\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">MainActivity.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">NavigationComposeExample</span>() {\n    <span class=\"c\">// Creamos el control de navegación</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> navController = <span class=\"f\">rememberNavController</span>()\n    <span class=\"c\">// Se obtiene el destino actual de la navegación</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> navBackStackEntry = navController.<span class=\"f\">currentBackStackEntryAsState</span>()\n    <span class=\"c\">// Se comprueba en qué pantalla nos encontramos</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> isHome = navBackStackEntry.<span class=\"k\">value</span>?.destination?.hasRoute&lt;<span class=\"t\">HomeRoute</span>&gt;() == <span class=\"k\">true</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> isFavourites = navBackStackEntry.<span class=\"k\">value</span>?.destination?.hasRoute&lt;<span class=\"t\">FavouritesRoute</span>&gt;() == <span class=\"k\">true</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> isSettings = navBackStackEntry.<span class=\"k\">value</span>?.destination?.hasRoute&lt;<span class=\"t\">SettingsRoute</span>&gt;() == <span class=\"k\">true</span>\n\n    <span class=\"c\">// Scaffold que contiene la NavigationBar y el NavGraph</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Scaffold</span>(\n        bottomBar = {\n            <span class=\"t\">NavigationBar</span> {\n                <span class=\"t\">NavigationBarItem</span>(\n                    selected = isHome,\n                    onClick = { navController.<span class=\"f\">navigate</span>(<span class=\"t\">HomeRoute</span>) },\n                    icon = {\n                        <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(\n                            imageVector = <span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Default</span>.<span class=\"t\">Home</span>,\n                            contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Navegación a HomeScreen&quot;</span>\n                        )\n                    },\n                    label = { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Home&quot;</span>) }\n                )\n                <span class=\"t\">NavigationBarItem</span>(\n                    selected = isFavourites,\n                    onClick = { navController.<span class=\"f\">navigate</span>(<span class=\"t\">FavouritesRoute</span>) },\n                    icon = {\n                        <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(\n                            imageVector = <span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Default</span>.<span class=\"t\">Favorite</span>,\n                            contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Navegación a FavouritesScreen&quot;</span>\n                        )\n                    },\n                    label = { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Favourites&quot;</span>) }\n                )\n                <span class=\"t\">NavigationBarItem</span>(\n                    selected = isSettings,\n                    onClick = { navController.<span class=\"f\">navigate</span>(<span class=\"t\">SettingsRoute</span>) },\n                    icon = {\n                        <span class=\"t\">Icon</span>(\n                            imageVector = <span class=\"t\">Icons</span>.<span class=\"t\">Default</span>.<span class=\"t\">Settings</span>,\n                            contentDescription = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Navegación a SettingsScreen&quot;</span>\n                        )\n                    },\n                    label = { <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Settings&quot;</span>) }\n                )\n            }\n        }\n    ) { paddingValues -&gt;\n        <span class=\"c\">// Contenido del Scaffold</span>\n        <span class=\"t\">NavGraph</span>(\n            navController = navController,\n            modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>.<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(paddingValues)\n        )\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"1\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">ui/navigation/NavGraph.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">NavGraph</span>(\n    navController: <span class=\"t\">NavHostController</span>,\n    modifier: <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span> = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>\n) {\n    <span class=\"t\">NavHost</span>(\n        navController = navController,\n        startDestination = <span class=\"t\">HomeRoute</span>,\n        modifier = modifier\n    ) {\n        composable&lt;<span class=\"t\">HomeRoute</span>&gt; {\n            <span class=\"t\">HomeScreen</span>()\n        }\n        composable&lt;<span class=\"t\">FavouritesRoute</span>&gt; {\n            <span class=\"t\">FavouritesScreen</span>()\n        }\n        composable&lt;<span class=\"t\">SettingsRoute</span>&gt; {\n            <span class=\"t\">SettingsScreen</span>()\n        }\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"2\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">ui/screens/HomeScreen.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"c\">// HomeScreen.kt (FavouritesScreen y SettingsScreen siguen la misma estructura)</span>\n<span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">HomeScreen</span>() {\n    <span class=\"t\">Column</span>(\n        modifier = <span class=\"t\">Modifier</span>\n            .<span class=\"f\">fillMaxSize</span>()\n            .<span class=\"f\">padding</span>(all = <span class=\"n\">16</span>.dp),\n        verticalArrangement = <span class=\"t\">Arrangement</span>.<span class=\"t\">Center</span>,\n        horizontalAlignment = <span class=\"t\">Alignment</span>.<span class=\"t\">CenterHorizontally</span>\n    ) {\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(\n            text = <span class=\"s\">&quot;Home&quot;</span>,\n            style = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.typography.headlineMedium,\n            color = <span class=\"t\">MaterialTheme</span>.colorScheme.primary\n        )\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div></div>", "subs": [{"id": "par-metros-de-navigationbaritem", "titulo": "Parámetros de NavigationBarItem"}], "codes": 3, "tables": 1}, {"id": "tema8-s4", "titulo": "4. Intents Implícitos", "html": "<p>Los <strong>Intents implícitos</strong> permiten reutilizar aplicaciones instaladas en el dispositivo para realizar determinadas acciones. Declaramos la intención de realizar una acción genérica <strong>sin indicar qué aplicación concreta debe ejecutarla</strong>, y el sistema operativo Android busca una app instalada capaz de realizarla (abrir una página web, mostrar el marcador telefónico, abrir una ubicación en un mapa, enviar un correo electrónico o abrir la cámara).</p><h3 id=\"componentes-de-un-intent-impl-cito\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Componentes de un Intent implícito</span></h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Componente</th><th>Cómo se define y ejemplos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Acción</strong></td><td>Constantes de la clase <code>Intent</code>: <code>Intent.ACTION_DIAL</code> (abrir el marcador telefónico), <code>Intent.ACTION_SENDTO</code> (crear un correo electrónico listo para enviar), <code>Intent.ACTION_WEB_SEARCH</code> (abrir un buscador web) o <code>Intent.ACTION_CALL</code> (iniciar llamada directa).</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Datos</strong></td><td>Información necesaria para la acción, proporcionada mediante <code>putExtra(clave, valor)</code> o creando objetos <code>Uri</code> (<em>Uniform Resource Identifier</em>) a partir de cadenas con <code>.toUri()</code>. Esquemas habituales: <code>tel:</code> (teléfonos), <code>https:</code> (páginas web), <code>geo:</code> (ubicaciones geográficas) y <code>mailto:</code> (correos electrónicos).</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout nota\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">Puedes consultar todas las acciones estándar y sus parámetros en la <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/guide/components/intents-common?hl=es-419\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Documentación oficial de Intents comunes en Android Developers</a>.</div></div><h3 id=\"procedimiento-para-lanzar-un-intent-impl-cito-desde-un-composable\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Procedimiento para lanzar un Intent implícito desde un Composable</span></h3><ol><li>Obtener el contexto de la aplicación utilizando <code>LocalContext.current</code>.</li><li>Crear el <code>Intent</code> implícito con la acción deseada.</li><li>Añadir los datos al <code>Intent</code> si son necesarios (<code>data</code> con <code>.toUri()</code> y/o <code>putExtra()</code>).</li><li>Lanzar el intent ejecutando la función <code>context.startActivity(intent)</code>.</li></ol><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">Kotlin</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"c\">// Ejemplo 1: Creación de Intent para enviar un correo (ACTION_SENDTO)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> intentEmail = <span class=\"t\">Intent</span>(action = <span class=\"t\">Intent</span>.<span class=\"t\">ACTION_SENDTO</span>).apply {\n    <span class=\"k\">data</span> = <span class=\"s\">&quot;mailto:ejemplo@gmail.com&quot;</span>.<span class=\"f\">toUri</span>()\n    <span class=\"f\">putExtra</span>(<span class=\"t\">Intent</span>.<span class=\"t\">EXTRA_SUBJECT</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Asunto&quot;</span>)\n    <span class=\"f\">putExtra</span>(<span class=\"t\">Intent</span>.<span class=\"t\">EXTRA_TEXT</span>, <span class=\"s\">&quot;Cuerpo del email&quot;</span>)\n}\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Ejemplo 2: Abrir el marcador telefónico desde un Button (ACTION_DIAL · Permiso Normal)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">val</span> context = <span class=\"t\">LocalContext</span>.current\n\n<span class=\"t\">Button</span>(\n    onClick = {\n        <span class=\"k\">val</span> intent = <span class=\"t\">Intent</span>(action = <span class=\"t\">Intent</span>.<span class=\"t\">ACTION_DIAL</span>).apply {\n            <span class=\"k\">data</span> = <span class=\"s\">&quot;tel:111222333&quot;</span>.<span class=\"f\">toUri</span>()\n        }\n        context.<span class=\"f\">startActivity</span>(intent)\n    }\n) {\n    <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(<span class=\"s\">&quot;Llamar&quot;</span>)\n}</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"sistema-de-permisos-en-tiempo-de-ejecuci-n-android-6-0-api-23\"><span class=\"h3-dot\"></span><span>Sistema de permisos en tiempo de ejecución (Android 6.0 / API 23+)</span></h3><p>A partir de Android 6.0 (API 23), los usuarios conceden permisos a las apps <strong>mientras se ejecutan</strong> (no al instalarlas), lo que simplifica la instalación y brinda mayor control al usuario (pudiendo revocar permisos en cualquier momento desde la configuración de la app).</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Categoría</th><th>Comportamiento y ejemplo</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Permisos normales</strong></td><td>No ponen en riesgo la privacidad del usuario de forma directa. Si se declaran en <code>AndroidManifest.xml</code>, el sistema los concede automáticamente. Ejemplo: <code>ACTION_DIAL</code> (muestra el marcador con el número introducido, pero es el usuario quien decide pulsar el botón de llamar).</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Permisos peligrosos</strong></td><td>Permiten acceder a información confidencial o ejecutar acciones sensibles directamente (como <code>ACTION_CALL</code> para iniciar una llamada telefónica sin pasar por el botón del marcador). Deben declararse en <code>AndroidManifest.xml</code> y, además, el usuario debe <strong>autorizarlos explícitamente durante la ejecución</strong> de la app.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout aviso\"><div class=\"callout-ic\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-and\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#3DDC84\" d=\"M17.6 11.48 L19.44 8.3 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 -0.63 l-1.88 3.24 a11.43 11.43 0 0 0 -8.94 0 L5.65 7.67 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 0.63 L6.4 11.48 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 1 20 h22 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 17.6 11.48 Z M7 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 8.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 7 17.25 Z M17 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 18.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 17 17.25 Z\"/></svg></div><div class=\"callout-body\">Para solicitar permisos peligrosos en Jetpack Compose usamos <strong><code>rememberLauncherForActivityResult</code></strong> con el contrato <strong><code>ActivityResultContracts.RequestPermission()</code></strong> y comprobamos previamente si ya está concedido con <strong><code>ContextCompat.checkSelfPermission()</code></strong>.</div></div><div class=\"tabs\"><div class=\"tab-heads\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab active\" data-i=\"0\" title=\"app/manifests/AndroidManifest.xml\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-and\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#3DDC84\" d=\"M17.6 11.48 L19.44 8.3 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 -0.63 l-1.88 3.24 a11.43 11.43 0 0 0 -8.94 0 L5.65 7.67 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 0.63 L6.4 11.48 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 1 20 h22 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 17.6 11.48 Z M7 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 8.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 7 17.25 Z M17 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 18.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 17 17.25 Z\"/></svg><span>AndroidManifest.xml</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab\" data-i=\"1\" title=\"MainActivity.kt\"><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span>MainActivity.kt</span></button></div><div class=\"tab-body active\" data-i=\"0\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"xml\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-and\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#3DDC84\" d=\"M17.6 11.48 L19.44 8.3 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 -0.63 l-1.88 3.24 a11.43 11.43 0 0 0 -8.94 0 L5.65 7.67 a0.63 0.63 0 0 0 -1.09 0.63 L6.4 11.48 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 1 20 h22 A10.81 10.81 0 0 0 17.6 11.48 Z M7 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 8.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 7 17.25 Z M17 17.25 A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 18.25 16 A1.25 1.25 0 0 1 17 17.25 Z\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">app/manifests/AndroidManifest.xml</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">ANDROID XML</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code>&lt;?xml <span class=\"a\">version</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;1.0&quot;</span> <span class=\"a\">encoding</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>?<span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">&lt;manifest</span> <span class=\"a\">xmlns:android</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"a\">xmlns:tools</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;http://schemas.android.com/tools&quot;</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"c\">&lt;!-- Permiso para realizar llamadas telefónicas --&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">&lt;uses-permission</span> <span class=\"a\">android:name</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;android.permission.CALL_PHONE&quot;</span> <span class=\"k\">/&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"c\">&lt;!-- La app podrá instalarse en dispositivos sin hardware para realizar llamadas --&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">&lt;uses-feature</span> <span class=\"a\">android:name</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;android.hardware.telephony&quot;</span> <span class=\"a\">android:required</span>=<span class=\"s\">&quot;false&quot;</span> <span class=\"k\">/&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">&lt;/manifest</span><span class=\"k\">&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div><div class=\"tab-body\" data-i=\"1\"><div class=\"code \" data-lang=\"kotlin\"><div class=\"code-head\"><div class=\"code-title\"><span class=\"code-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><svg class=\"ic-svg ic-kt\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"kt-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7F52FF\"/><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#C711E1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F88909\"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon fill=\"url(#kt-g)\" points=\"2,2 22,2 12,12 22,22 2,22\"/></svg><span class=\"code-file\">MainActivity.kt</span><span class=\"code-lang-pill\">KOTLIN</span></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>Copiar</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"c\">// Función encargada de lanzar el Intent implícito de llamada directa</span>\n<span class=\"k\">private</span> <span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"f\">realizarLlamada</span>(context: <span class=\"t\">Context</span>) {\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> intentLlamar = <span class=\"t\">Intent</span>(action = <span class=\"t\">Intent</span>.<span class=\"t\">ACTION_CALL</span>).apply {\n        <span class=\"k\">data</span> = <span class=\"s\">&quot;tel:111222333&quot;</span>.<span class=\"f\">toUri</span>()\n    }\n    context.<span class=\"f\">startActivity</span>(intentLlamar)\n}\n\n<span class=\"c\">// Composable que solicita permisos en tiempo de ejecución y realiza la llamada</span>\n<span class=\"a\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"t\">ActionCall</span>() {\n    <span class=\"c\">// Se obtiene el contexto de la aplicación</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> context = <span class=\"t\">LocalContext</span>.current\n\n    <span class=\"c\">// rememberLauncherForActivityResult(): crea el launcher que solicita los permisos al usuario</span>\n    <span class=\"c\">// y recibe el resultado. &quot;remember&quot; conserva el launcher durante las recomposiciones.</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">val</span> permisoLauncher = <span class=\"f\">rememberLauncherForActivityResult</span>(\n        contract = <span class=\"t\">ActivityResultContracts</span>.<span class=\"t\">RequestPermission</span>()\n    ) { permisoConcedido -&gt;\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> (permisoConcedido) {\n            <span class=\"f\">realizarLlamada</span>(context)\n        } <span class=\"k\">else</span> {\n            <span class=\"t\">Toast</span>.<span class=\"f\">makeText</span>(\n                context,\n                <span class=\"s\">&quot;No se ha concedido el permiso para llamar&quot;</span>,\n                <span class=\"t\">Toast</span>.<span class=\"t\">LENGTH_SHORT</span>\n            ).<span class=\"f\">show</span>()\n        }\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"c\">// Botón que comprueba el permiso y lanza la llamada o solicita autorización</span>\n    <span class=\"t\">Button</span>(\n        onClick = {\n            <span class=\"k\">if</span> (<span class=\"t\">ContextCompat</span>.<span class=\"f\">checkSelfPermission</span>(\n                    context,\n                    <span class=\"t\">Manifest</span>.permission.<span class=\"t\">CALL_PHONE</span>\n                ) == <span class=\"t\">PackageManager</span>.<span class=\"t\">PERMISSION_GRANTED</span>\n            ) {\n                <span class=\"f\">realizarLlamada</span>(context)\n            } <span class=\"k\">else</span> {\n                permisoLauncher.<span class=\"f\">launch</span>(<span class=\"t\">Manifest</span>.permission.<span class=\"t\">CALL_PHONE</span>)\n            }\n        }\n    ) {\n        <span class=\"t\">Text</span>(text = <span class=\"s\">&quot;LLAMAR&quot;</span>)\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div></div>", "subs": [{"id": "componentes-de-un-intent-impl-cito", "titulo": "Componentes de un Intent implícito"}, {"id": "procedimiento-para-lanzar-un-intent-impl-cito-desde-un-composable", "titulo": "Procedimiento para lanzar un Intent implícito desde un Composable"}, {"id": "sistema-de-permisos-en-tiempo-de-ejecuci-n-android-6-0-api-23", "titulo": "Sistema de permisos en tiempo de ejecución (Android 6.0 / API 23+)"}], "codes": 3, "tables": 2}]}];
